<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="&quot;TRANSACTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to actions taken, especially financial or operational dealings, that are collectively governed under the terms of the Agreement by the Borrower and its affiliates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the collective transactions related to the Allergan Acquisition that are financed under the Term Facility."</data>
