<node id="&quot;DOMESTIC SUBSIDIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A subsidiary company that is involved in the Borrower's financing arrangements and may be required to act as a Guarantor under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any Subsidiary of the Borrower substantially based in the United States, excluding certain exceptions related to the nature of their operations."</data>
