  <data key="d1">"Refers to restrictions imposed by governing bodies to regulate activities and financial transactions, mentioned in reference to compliance obligations of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sanctions refer to the legal regulations that must not be violated in the use of Advances by the Borrower or any member of the Consolidated Group."</data>
