  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Specific purposes for which the Borrower is required to allocate certain funds, as set out in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The proceeds of the Advances shall be available, and the Borrower agrees that it shall apply such proceeds, solely towards Certain Funds Purposes."</data>
