<node id="&quot;COMMITMENT FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A non-refundable fee paid by the borrower to the lenders as part of the financing arrangement, calculated on the outstanding commitments."</data>
