  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Anti-Corruption Laws are legal frameworks that prohibit bribery and corrupt practices which the Borrower must ensure compliance with during its operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Laws that prevent fraud, bribery, and corruption in financial transactions, relevant to the Borrower's operations and compliance requirements."</data>
