  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An appointed entity responsible for managing certain obligations or assets under the Transaction Agreement, as specified in relation to Existing Public Notes."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity or individual appointed to manage assets on behalf of others, particularly relevant in the administration of certain provisions within credit agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity that is responsible for administering and managing the trust and ensuring compliance with the terms of the agreement."</data>
