  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Lender that is currently fulfilling its obligations under the loan agreement and has not defaulted on any terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Lender that is in good standing and has fulfilled its contractual obligations under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cdfa67546811206c5bc91d4f4c01b35c55878522beb7caefd3c918cc7bb0e4b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5101875bbe6af73647ed36abe0f23011cd57aa7a0b2cfc76e2acb7141d4d3d</data>
