<node id="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A corporation, partnership, joint venture, limited liability company, trust, or estate where more than 50% of the Voting Stock is owned or controlled by another Person."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any company controlled by the Borrower, playing a significant role in the financial structure and obligations relating to the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Subsidiaries of the Borrower are entities that may be required to guarantee specific obligations under the agreement, specifically those wholly-owned by the Borrower."</data>
