<node id="&quot;USA PATRIOT ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A law enacted to enhance the U.S. government's ability to monitor and prevent terrorism, referenced as part of the Borrower's compliance obligations."</data>
