<node id="&quot;BRIDGE FACILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A borrowing facility that may be used by the Borrower if the New Senior Notes are not issued prior to the consummation of the Allergan Acquisition."&lt;SEP&gt;"A financial arrangement related to commitments that might be impacted by increases in cash consideration."&lt;SEP&gt;"A senior unsecured 364-day credit facility detailed within the context of a specific credit agreement dated June 25, 2019, involving the Borrower and certain lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"A short-term loan arrangement that provides essential short-term funding."&lt;SEP&gt;"A structured credit or loan arrangement from which the Borrower's commitments shall be reduced by $6,000,000,000 concurrently with the Effective Date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-218e43d49365393bf48168169286d22a5df7ee1b88b398c5561de8f95be5878f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6994e4a2a327ca8ded0895f6c5bcd792c447ea6bba1255ec52fc3db7ad808b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28b00f9050b45438aaf9a96762d4e5d77883ad3c6c6c0357a69caf07f0abf4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7493bb66f0421335c6ef87034d49cf6bf9d3d02f08284e06abb442b159d239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f8d5bdd05b7cd0d1c2d946f291696266d96f16ce4e2c34eb03dcb8cc207d234</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTERNAL REVENUE CODE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Internal Revenue Code is the relevant body of laws governing the taxation of income, including provisions affecting lenders and borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The U.S. Internal Revenue Code of 1986, as amended, and regulations and rulings issued thereunder."&lt;SEP&gt;"The tax code governing federal tax laws in the United States, which may impact financial operations and obligations of entities involved in credit agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-40d0120536be1b8e96b2f903daf9881c37b0db7176468dc8bbbf490240624e03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2532dceb11310f90fe874dcb7a03665b47bca038a4f5360f466bf9fb8d95bca4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-750ac8915cdc1e091b22651f034329ee2d71a189874655a3a3f1357281f1f818</data>
