  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A notification that allows the Borrower to convert financial instruments under specific circumstances outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The written notice required to inform the Administrative Agent about the Borrower's election related to the Takeover Offer."</data>
