<node id="&quot;INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Insurance refers to coverage that the Borrower is required to maintain to protect against various risks, a commitment essential for ensuring financial stability and compliance with the terms of the credit agreement."</data>
