</node>
<node id="&quot;WAIVER OF JURY TRIAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WAIVER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal provision where each party waives their right to trial by jury in relation to the actions arising from the agreement, indicating a decision to resolve disputes without a jury."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-245f24acd98603313a2446a8d5a32f7a192d4383d71b7f423ff6fdab962825e4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EEA MEMBER COUNTRY&quot;">
