</node>
<node id="&quot;EXISTENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Existence refers to the requirement that the Borrower must maintain its legal status and operational capacity to fulfill its obligations under the agreement."</data>
