<node id="&quot;3-YEAR TRANCHE COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The commitment of a Lender to make an Advance as detailed in Section 2.01(b) of the credit agreement, which can vary in amount over time."</data>
