<node id="&quot;GUARANTEE REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Specifications that outline the conditions under which a subsidiary of the Borrower must act as a Guarantor."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific legal requirements that must be met for guarantees provided in the context of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3572813e4fb97fffeaa5cf8aa5591bc7eadcda80d2654bfbcfcc30832c77f0bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f1c734d846f35a655ca01c490cae44d5b50d73762de164b96169839717dc150</data>
