</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal document that outlines the terms and conditions applicable to the loan agreement between the lender and the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal, legally binding contract outlining the rights, obligations, and terms between two or more parties, particularly in relation to loans and financing arrangements."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal, legally binding contract outlining the rights, obligations, and terms under which the Lender provides funds to the Borrower, and includes specific conditions and covenants related to the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal, legally binding contract that outlines the rights, obligations, and terms related to the loan, specifying the processes involving the Borrower and Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documents that outline the terms and conditions of the loan, essential to the execution and enforcement of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Document entails any documents related to loans, which may include loan agreements, certificates, and other relevant paperwork in connection with the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Document refers to the formal agreements that outline the terms and conditions under which loans are provided, including the rights and obligations of the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Documents are formal contracts that detail the terms and conditions related to the loan, including the Credit Agreement and any amendments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan documents are formal agreements that outline the terms of the loan between the lender and borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Document refers to the formal agreement outlining the terms and conditions for the Borrower to receive funds from the Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-09df4feeafeebaa1db1ae1c32b8120452e92a0f2f211ab28b71688732612bd4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-557ca50e2e7ed07027fe1bc3a3d46b4aca0b92a15a8793019d9d077f72596b84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6fecb6c14e74dc19c2d2c6c0027fa29dee78b526e13ea8a2ff95880d1d5fd24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea2fcc7ba04310baa44bb49e42022c0e5cae9efe737efd7e3181f2be9502aaf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-750ac8915cdc1e091b22651f034329ee2d71a189874655a3a3f1357281f1f818&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f48aac073454f64321c0cdc25d2c032423f2d9bb3784ae8f741bfbe60eb624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be7bce265f7668641305b669fcfae3cec84ce21e98d4c457d96cadd73dddfbf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d70cab643a5ecddd1b740e1e4acaa3c84ead62d9e90fb3c04b7381a845ad6613&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fc31ef983e1fb2ce3b22784dd6f7b34a4f434eb6a46077483cb44955bbb2668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-492bd425f44531b53e489ea3b2caba91dc56c30bd67efa35312d27305ba2b45f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 2.06&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific section outlining the repayment obligations for advances made to the borrower, detailing how repayments will occur for different tranches."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 2.06 outlines specific terms related to the payment or conversion conditions for Eurocurrency Rate Advances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7af28d15bebf0aa3c3c5d3e5c5b05093f378e5f6d86107e87b93c7d9adb5bca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3fd5f2a6fbb9e2996bf6411ed3c5457faf2d2bd6c6bf8b0821ae37e4c465ac6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MERGER OR CONSOLIDATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Merger or Consolidation refers to the potential actions by the Borrower that could affect its structure, permissible under the credit agreement’s terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b8f799d61b01f18934ea147ca074e5f3a01f511964c2cab511d835f90610d21b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
