</node>
<node id="&quot;5-YEAR TRANCHE COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The commitment of a Lender to make an Advance pursuant to Section 2.01(c) of the credit agreement, with an initial amount specified in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5c587e6b1345a423983f8f8f9bdc79596cc74be7c5d91c1332688e48263c116a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMBARGOED PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GUARANTOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An individual or entity that is prohibited from conducting business due to government sanctions, relevant to the Borrower's compliance obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"any entity subject to sanctions that can affect inabilities to enforce repayment obligations under the loan agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-22981ba75cbdf796a13889f833879f18b5cb8cb79562d8354336d507ba15fd3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dece15a26450f3f3b7005a23a1a87b75619c152d1c0c3fb518d24ff11d52843a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GUARANTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GUARANTOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Guarantor is any of the subsidiaries that guarantees the obligations of the Borrower under the agreement, providing assurance to the lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that provides additional assurance to the lender by agreeing to repay the loan if the primary borrower defaults, making it a crucial party in the credit arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that provides additional assurance to the lender by agreeing to repay the loan if the primary borrower defaults."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity that provides a guarantee for the loan, agreeing to fulfill obligations if the primary borrower defaults."&lt;SEP&gt;"it is required to obtain, verify and record information that identifies the Borrower and any Guarantor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f1c734d846f35a655ca01c490cae44d5b50d73762de164b96169839717dc150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3572813e4fb97fffeaa5cf8aa5591bc7eadcda80d2654bfbcfcc30832c77f0bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eddc25353ee9ca05b2f15a8a75b64381aa496d6afbc99dd68ffaa3c9aedb55d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1583e8d86bec46433cba76eeee6ae8e3d0cee281e57ae7251a6206ddbe83f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2bfe906a99dc77a8d4ae5a8cc5d7410e85fbdbb82f47beec1071bdf4298102&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2951db15aa0742a2d43bdc126f93e2eba8a987444d5ce22c69f3f9840be94c51</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
