  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific section of the agreement detailing exceptions to restrictions on transactions with Affiliates, which outlines permissible actions and related terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule 5.01(h) refers to a specific section within the credit agreement that outlines details related to various provisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e3429c52130dabc93f4ab7252b26c46edc84a30f8a108dc1e7221d46f531083e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8728e39e0e185ee39416c3955fb41ec94d2eef3c5f813cb8b6099f868cf5e02a</data>
