<node id="&quot;5-YEAR TRANCHE LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Lender that has a 5-Year Tranche Commitment or holds a 5-Year Tranche Advance, guiding the lending process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each 5-Year Tranche Lender severally and not jointly agrees, to advance same day funds denominated in Dollars to the Administrative Agent on the Pre-Closing Funding Date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d736172953986f05ce85f8300a40bec7b10118ae499cda09fcb21daf31749287&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c587e6b1345a423983f8f8f9bdc79596cc74be7c5d91c1332688e48263c116a</data>
