  <data key="d2">chunk-22981ba75cbdf796a13889f833879f18b5cb8cb79562d8354336d507ba15fd3a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HAZARDOUS MATERIALS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hazardous Materials are substances that may pose risks to health or the environment and are referenced in relation to liabilities and environmental considerations in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Substances classified as hazardous or toxic, which may pose liabilities or obligations under environmental laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"Substances that can pose risks to health and the environment, which the Consolidated Group must manage under regulatory requirements, affecting creditworthiness."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a1be752fddafadca456c3e43e27d986816dd534c81a0fe1e60a9008d633a048d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0ed6d0a7062e2fb3635c3defcdbad07963741b071cdc36d7c4b34749a2e718a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3572813e4fb97fffeaa5cf8aa5591bc7eadcda80d2654bfbcfcc30832c77f0bd</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PREVIOUSLY DELIVERED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The collective reference for previously provided financial data, including both audited and unaudited financial statements related to the Borrower and the Allergan Group."&lt;SEP&gt;"These statements, related to the Borrower and Allergan, showcase the financial health and performance metrics required for evaluation under the credit agreement."</data>
