<node id="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL ACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal action initiated regarding violations of environmental laws, which could have financial repercussions for the Consolidated Group as outlined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental Action references any legal or regulatory actions related to environmental compliance that could impact the Borrower's standing in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental Action relates to any legal proceedings or investigations regarding the presence of Hazardous Materials on properties associated with the Consolidated Group."&lt;SEP&gt;"Means any action, suit, demand, demand letter, claim, notice of noncompliance or violation, notice of liability or potential liability, investigation, proceeding, consent order or consent agreement relating in any way to any Environmental Law, Environmental Permit or Hazardous Materials."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a1be752fddafadca456c3e43e27d986816dd534c81a0fe1e60a9008d633a048d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0ed6d0a7062e2fb3635c3defcdbad07963741b071cdc36d7c4b34749a2e718a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-142c397a832b42dbdc53d33c57b5fc3071b7dd392bb60fa3e16f40ae3c2de06f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dab0531fa4fcf86f70f5a6e071aafc6b5ff5db2eaa35dfe862105382145767e3</data>
