  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legislative act designed to prevent and combat money laundering and other financial crimes, relevant for compliance documentation related to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legislative act referenced in legal contexts that entails various compliance requirements for financial institutions and may affect transactions outlined in the Loan Document."</data>
