</node>
<node id="&quot;ADVANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A sum of money that is lent out as per the terms set forth in the credit agreement, which can be drawn down by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Advance refers to the act of providing funds from the Lender to the Borrower under the agreed terms of the credit arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Advance refers to the funds provided to the Borrower that remain unpaid under the credit agreement, representing a specific commitment by the Lender to disburse financial resources."&lt;SEP&gt;"An advance made by a Lender to the Borrower as part of a Borrowing under the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Funds provided by the Lender to the Borrower under the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the funds provided to the Borrower as part of the Borrowing process under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Advance refers to the amount of money provided by the Lender to the Borrower under the terms set forth in the Agreement, which must be repaid in accordance with the outlined schedule."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amount of funds that a lender agrees to provide to the borrower as part of the borrowing process under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amount of money that lenders are committed to disburse for certain funds purposes under the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amount of money that the lender commits to provide to the borrower under the terms of the credit agreement, which must be repaid according to specified conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7af28d15bebf0aa3c3c5d3e5c5b05093f378e5f6d86107e87b93c7d9adb5bca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c304cf98860a9b7cd463eae177e2e2d7d98281b29032cd76ecb286c9b22dcdde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14dc72f1acf50414a477c2db2c796ddbbd61a6a79ce8e689f589c7f4fe13c8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a4b11d9d570dfb94869367bf658bbf44c8a288c83406b056f2db68067634598&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f1c734d846f35a655ca01c490cae44d5b50d73762de164b96169839717dc150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75613d643837057320625a58ba941f8502befaca16be62f4c54375e5e369d410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-597b1ede56981d624f07ccc3f1c7ed2f4536e00810d740fb60781f9e5feb7ce8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8f799d61b01f18934ea147ca074e5f3a01f511964c2cab511d835f90610d21b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fc31ef983e1fb2ce3b22784dd6f7b34a4f434eb6a46077483cb44955bbb2668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c587e6b1345a423983f8f8f9bdc79596cc74be7c5d91c1332688e48263c116a</data>
