  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Advance made by a 3-Year Tranche Lender to the Borrower under Section 2.01(b) of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific advance of funds provided to the Borrower under the 3-Year Tranche arrangement, bound by the terms of the agreement."</data>
