<node id="&quot;SUBSIDIARIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Companies controlled by the Borrower that are required to keep proper books of record and account and maintain properties used in business activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that are controlled by the Borrower and may also have financial obligations connected to the Debt of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that are controlled or owned by the Borrower, playing a role in various transactions and agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Subsidiaries are the legal entities that are controlled by the Company and are obligated under the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Subsidiaries indicate the entities that are owned or controlled by the Borrower, which may also participate in the transactions outlined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Subsidiaries refer to the companies controlled by the Borrower, contributing to the consolidated financials."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddc8ad50c1474639d452ac21cf074a091bed8d9d40db09df3a4b4bd23b32e37c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c9bd21b64b200eb5b45b32553c4dacfef2d7eae4b803edeb5ad9b275a0824cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8728e39e0e185ee39416c3955fb41ec94d2eef3c5f813cb8b6099f868cf5e02a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3fd5f2a6fbb9e2996bf6411ed3c5457faf2d2bd6c6bf8b0821ae37e4c465ac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-597b1ede56981d624f07ccc3f1c7ed2f4536e00810d740fb60781f9e5feb7ce8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea2fcc7ba04310baa44bb49e42022c0e5cae9efe737efd7e3181f2be9502aaf6</data>
