<node id="&quot;AFFILIATES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Affiliates are entities that are associated with the Company and also have obligations related to the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Affiliates of the Lender are related entities that may also partake in the financial dealings and agreements set forth."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities or individuals that have a relationship with a person, influencing the description under 'Related Parties.'"&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that are related to the Borrower but are not part of the Consolidated Group, influencing the terms of financial transactions."</data>
