</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A broadly defined entity that can include various legal forms, such as individuals, corporations, partnerships, and government entities, referenced in determining obligations under the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"An individual or entity referenced in the context as involved in the transaction, subject to legal obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any individual or entity that may acquire beneficial ownership of the Voting Stock of the Borrower, affecting control and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any individual or legal entity other than the Borrower or ERISA Affiliates that may have an obligation under the terms defined."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to any individual or legal entity involved in the context of the defined term 'Related Parties.'"&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to any individual or legal entity that can engage in legal or financial transactions, potentially involved in transactions with the Borrower or Consolidated Group."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Person refers to any individual or entity fulfilling contractual obligations under the Agreement, particularly concerning the Lender's entrance into the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"any individual or legal entity defined in the agreement with specific performance obligations as detailed within the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"any individual or legal entity referenced within the agreement that can hold obligations or rights under the terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-09df4feeafeebaa1db1ae1c32b8120452e92a0f2f211ab28b71688732612bd4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f940048c4d5b2bb225205fb7d95deb9809eacaf8b9d8f8727a53a822a960d8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdfa67546811206c5bc91d4f4c01b35c55878522beb7caefd3c918cc7bb0e4b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-515a1f26d42a2ffc1dced7e36195ac619bbb7de89e946f61c0ea6dedc03cb138&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9596d6913071768b731e90c3fce70fd8e8b7dce447b1bd785f16af66c5018e80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1583e8d86bec46433cba76eeee6ae8e3d0cee281e57ae7251a6206ddbe83f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8728e39e0e185ee39416c3955fb41ec94d2eef3c5f813cb8b6099f868cf5e02a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-597b1ede56981d624f07ccc3f1c7ed2f4536e00810d740fb60781f9e5feb7ce8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22981ba75cbdf796a13889f833879f18b5cb8cb79562d8354336d507ba15fd3a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
