<node id="&quot;HIGH COURT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"High Court of Ireland is a legal entity that serves as a judicial institution in Ireland."&lt;SEP&gt;"The court with the authority to sanction major agreements or resolutions in connection with corporate actions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-40d0120536be1b8e96b2f903daf9881c37b0db7176468dc8bbbf490240624e03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f67a33f5df6562c3788421c933dfc2f1287e8f4e4596bbd09e2b3a2f360ddf57</data>
