</node>
<node id="&quot;AGENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Designated entities tasked with managing the administrative and operational aspects of the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities or individuals responsible for managing administrative aspects of the credit agreement, ensuring compliance and coordination among participants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parties including agents involved in the capacities and roles described under 'Related Parties.'"&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to any individuals or entities acting on behalf of the Lender or the Borrower in accordance with the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Agents are responsible for arranging services regarding the credit agreement, acting primarily as principals in transactions with the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dece15a26450f3f3b7005a23a1a87b75619c152d1c0c3fb518d24ff11d52843a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75613d643837057320625a58ba941f8502befaca16be62f4c54375e5e369d410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-273fad25f21e3733d9bd3b4f4f05c87cc55bb9453212fdf3c7691185ee536587&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-515a1f26d42a2ffc1dced7e36195ac619bbb7de89e946f61c0ea6dedc03cb138&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-245f24acd98603313a2446a8d5a32f7a192d4383d71b7f423ff6fdab962825e4</data>
