</node>
<node id="&quot;REGISTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A maintained record that contains the names, addresses of the Lenders, and their respective Commitments and Advances, ensuring clarity in the obligations under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Register is a record maintained by the Administrative Agent that details the assignments and assumptions of rights under the Loan Document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-273fad25f21e3733d9bd3b4f4f05c87cc55bb9453212fdf3c7691185ee536587&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f48aac073454f64321c0cdc25d2c032423f2d9bb3784ae8f741bfbe60eb624</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEPENDENT PUBLIC ACCOUNTANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Independent public accountants are required to audit the Borrower's financial documentation and provide an unqualified opinion on its accuracy and status."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-644f37b010df65db1ef78b4233dc4b1dda2518dde20d55002acab8c9c4b9dada</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PATEI&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Patei is associated with Devan, signifying involvement in the formal actions related to the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-54ab6079929cef0e05bceb2cf943ddd1dc8d76e8884c9b7c12ddd867bc4020bc</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MATERIAL ACQUISITION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A significant purchase or investment that involves financing through Acquisition Debt by the Borrower or its Subsidiaries."&lt;SEP&gt;"A term used within the credit agreement referring to significant transactions that may impact financial covenants and operational leverage ratios."&lt;SEP&gt;"An acquisition that involves the payment of a significant amount of consideration, affecting the Borrower's financial condition and obligations under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2277d9071e073b486c921e5a5a70aadfb55298cb8f05fd2067d7a9260f30eded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-597b1ede56981d624f07ccc3f1c7ed2f4536e00810d740fb60781f9e5feb7ce8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd2f3c18ca40f5744b1fae1009fdd54117d901009e82d32923eeabad1f6473ae</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EU BAIL-IN LEGISLATION SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The EU Bail-In Legislation Schedule published by the Loan Market Association that governs related financial arrangements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59856153649b40596d478b3e3da65ad43c5f06c034b24225cd62242ce120ef82</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Collectively refers to banks and financial institutions listed as lenders in the agreement and eligible assignees."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that provide loans to the borrower and have commitments defined in the loan documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that provide the loan to the Borrower, responsible for disbursing funds and monitoring compliance with the loan document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders are financial institutions or entities that provide the loan to the Borrower, responsible for disbursing funds and monitoring compliance with the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders refers to multiple financial institutions or entities that provide loan funding and hold various rights and obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Parties that provide credit under the specified Agreement, holding certain representations and obligations associated with extending or maintaining the credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders are financial entities that provide loans to the Borrower and receive payments of principal, interest, and fees in accordance with the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders are the financial institutions or entities party to the Term Loan Credit Agreement that provide funding to the Company, AbbVie Inc."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders are the financial institutions or entities that provide the loan to the Borrower, and are referenced as parties that receive financial statements and reports from the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders provide financing under the terms of the credit agreement and have significant commercial involvement with the Borrower and its Affiliates."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders provide loan amounts to the borrower and require interest payments as stipulated in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders provide the loan to the Borrower, responsible for funding and compliance monitoring."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders that hold interests regarding the Borrower's obligations and compliance with the terms of the Takeover Offer."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial institutions or entities providing the loan to the Borrower, responsible for disbursing funds and monitoring compliance with the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial institutions or entities that provide loans to the Borrower, responsible for disbursing funds and ensuring compliance with the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial institutions providing the loan to the Borrower, responsible for disbursing funds and overseeing compliance with the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term 'Lenders' encompasses all financial institutions or entities that provide funds to the borrower under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term refers to the financial entities providing loans under the credit agreement, responsible for disbursing funds and monitoring compliance with the terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d7e324da9ca1b1564ebc9a89d11b7e3f3471a27e48cdcb34c0c7216ce61d335f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dece15a26450f3f3b7005a23a1a87b75619c152d1c0c3fb518d24ff11d52843a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58c9046d0a5484a6d24c79e57ff3a85f3a4fe99c02f6ce803165f080f36b286b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a70fa6c5f50dc33cf7d4933da334c4321b8fa5279374e7f6cc64694458cdb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8728e39e0e185ee39416c3955fb41ec94d2eef3c5f813cb8b6099f868cf5e02a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f67a33f5df6562c3788421c933dfc2f1287e8f4e4596bbd09e2b3a2f360ddf57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2bfe906a99dc77a8d4ae5a8cc5d7410e85fbdbb82f47beec1071bdf4298102&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f8d5bdd05b7cd0d1c2d946f291696266d96f16ce4e2c34eb03dcb8cc207d234&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7af28d15bebf0aa3c3c5d3e5c5b05093f378e5f6d86107e87b93c7d9adb5bca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0b256098128c95020c20f34577c7172b60522b7f1b6d5f27dde05471ddb586b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-644f37b010df65db1ef78b4233dc4b1dda2518dde20d55002acab8c9c4b9dada&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f48aac073454f64321c0cdc25d2c032423f2d9bb3784ae8f741bfbe60eb624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3fd5f2a6fbb9e2996bf6411ed3c5457faf2d2bd6c6bf8b0821ae37e4c465ac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-245f24acd98603313a2446a8d5a32f7a192d4383d71b7f423ff6fdab962825e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-492bd425f44531b53e489ea3b2caba91dc56c30bd67efa35312d27305ba2b45f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75613d643837057320625a58ba941f8502befaca16be62f4c54375e5e369d410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40d0120536be1b8e96b2f903daf9881c37b0db7176468dc8bbbf490240624e03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b51600eae536cd47259633337cdac9c729e6dcdfe218308793a634df08bf67a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd2f3c18ca40f5744b1fae1009fdd54117d901009e82d32923eeabad1f6473ae</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRUSTEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Entities referred to as trustees in the context of Related Parties, signifying a fiduciary duty."</data>
