</node>
<node id="&quot;AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A designated entity often a bank or financial intermediary tasked with managing the administrative and operational aspects of the credit agreement, including fund disbursement, communication, and coordination among participants."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity designated to act on behalf of Lenders in coordinating and managing the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Agent, usually acting as the Administrative Agent, manages the administrative tasks on behalf of the Lenders and ensures compliance with the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a1be752fddafadca456c3e43e27d986816dd534c81a0fe1e60a9008d633a048d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-557ca50e2e7ed07027fe1bc3a3d46b4aca0b92a15a8793019d9d077f72596b84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1583e8d86bec46433cba76eeee6ae8e3d0cee281e57ae7251a6206ddbe83f43</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CASH CONSIDERATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cash Consideration refers to the amount to be paid by the Borrower for the Allergan Shares as part of the Scheme, subject to stringent conditions related to increases."&lt;SEP&gt;"The monetary amount that will be provided in exchange for the Allergan Shares as per the Takeover Offer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58c9046d0a5484a6d24c79e57ff3a85f3a4fe99c02f6ce803165f080f36b286b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f8d5bdd05b7cd0d1c2d946f291696266d96f16ce4e2c34eb03dcb8cc207d234</data>
