</node>
<node id="&quot;KRISTIE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Kristie Li is identified as the Senior Vice President, indicating a specific date of execution for the agreement on behalf of DNB CAPITAL LLC."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-54ab6079929cef0e05bceb2cf943ddd1dc8d76e8884c9b7c12ddd867bc4020bc</data>
