</node>
<node id="&quot;MATURITY DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATURITY DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Maturity Date is the predetermined final due date for the repayment of the loan, signaling the end of the loan term when all outstanding principal and accrued interest must be repaid."&lt;SEP&gt;"The predetermined date by which the borrower must repay the total outstanding principal of the loan under the credit facility."&lt;SEP&gt;"The predetermined final due date for the repayment of the loan under the credit agreement, indicating when all obligations must be fulfilled."&lt;SEP&gt;"The predetermined final due date for the repayment of the loan, marking the end of the loan term."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7af28d15bebf0aa3c3c5d3e5c5b05093f378e5f6d86107e87b93c7d9adb5bca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f67a33f5df6562c3788421c933dfc2f1287e8f4e4596bbd09e2b3a2f360ddf57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73be087e93080f9e436892b7d182df66394bc79dbf5df119d9357df61b1ebbfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd2f3c18ca40f5744b1fae1009fdd54117d901009e82d32923eeabad1f6473ae</data>
