</node>
<node id="&quot;OTHER TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Additional charges or levies other than standard taxes that may apply to the borrower under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Present or future stamp and documentary Taxes and any other excise or property Taxes arising from any payment made under a Loan Document or from its execution, delivery, or registration."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-557ca50e2e7ed07027fe1bc3a3d46b4aca0b92a15a8793019d9d077f72596b84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be7bce265f7668641305b669fcfae3cec84ce21e98d4c457d96cadd73dddfbf0</data>
