</node>
<node id="&quot;SYNDICATION AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An entity responsible for managing the syndication of the loan, assisting in the distribution of financial responsibilities among lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"MUFG Bank, Ltd., which acts as the agent for the syndication of loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-597b1ede56981d624f07ccc3f1c7ed2f4536e00810d740fb60781f9e5feb7ce8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78950c530681eb30ebd5dd748958c0ddb8dd93b84a33af76f5beae6548792ae1</data>
