</node>
<node id="&quot;EUROCURRENCY RATE ADVANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Advance that bears interest based on the Eurocurrency Rate, involving the LIBOR as a key component of the interest calculation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eurocurrency Rate Advance represents a type of advance where the interest rate is benchmarked against Eurocurrency rates for borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower may revoke any request for a Eurocurrency Rate Advance during any Benchmark Unavailability Period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59856153649b40596d478b3e3da65ad43c5f06c034b24225cd62242ce120ef82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f67a33f5df6562c3788421c933dfc2f1287e8f4e4596bbd09e2b3a2f360ddf57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02cd2de7855a70053b6f42c94faa792dc8fbc29bf53fd9cac8a0dca0ec0751b7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MASTER AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Master Agreement refers to a set of terms and conditions that govern various financial transactions, which may include obligations or liabilities under specific agreements like the International Swaps and Derivatives Association agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f67a33f5df6562c3788421c933dfc2f1287e8f4e4596bbd09e2b3a2f360ddf57</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESIGNATION EFFECTIVE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The date on which a resignation is considered effective, as defined in Section 7.06(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date when the resignation of the retiring Administrative Agent becomes effective, marking the transition of responsibilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5c5be4b86bb874c0ebcd5df3142d803b7aef8e7c1c715535d330936fe5a0dce9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-515a1f26d42a2ffc1dced7e36195ac619bbb7de89e946f61c0ea6dedc03cb138</data>
