  <data key="d1">"Taxes imposed as a result of an assignment or the designation of a new Applicable Lending Office, impacting the Borrower and Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-557ca50e2e7ed07027fe1bc3a3d46b4aca0b92a15a8793019d9d077f72596b84</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 4.01(F)(II)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 4.01(f)(ii) refers to a specific provision within the credit agreement that pertains to the notice of actions and litigation affecting the Consolidated Group."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58c9046d0a5484a6d24c79e57ff3a85f3a4fe99c02f6ce803165f080f36b286b</data>
