</node>
<node id="&quot;BANCO SANTANDER, S.A., NEW YORK BRANCH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Banco Santander, S.A., New York Branch is identified as a lender contributing to the loan structure as outlined in the term loan commitments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0acc60f8a909dc9fb1cf54a1cf46218765eaf98dfc26d26b6f7432172f07047a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOCUMENTATION AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An entity responsible for overseeing the documentation processes related to the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The designated agents responsible for the documentation related to the credit agreement, specifically Barclays Bank PLC, BNP Paribas, Citibank, N.A. and HSBC Bank USA, N.A."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2532dceb11310f90fe874dcb7a03665b47bca038a4f5360f466bf9fb8d95bca4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-597b1ede56981d624f07ccc3f1c7ed2f4536e00810d740fb60781f9e5feb7ce8</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXCLUDED TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Taxes that are explicitly excluded from the obligations within the credit agreement, as described in Section 2.14(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes, levies, imposts, deductions, charges, and withholdings in respect of payments under any Loan Document that are specifically excluded from obligations of the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59856153649b40596d478b3e3da65ad43c5f06c034b24225cd62242ce120ef82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-557ca50e2e7ed07027fe1bc3a3d46b4aca0b92a15a8793019d9d077f72596b84</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IMPACTED INTEREST PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Impacted Interest Period refers to a specific duration set for Eurocurrency Rate that impacts the obligation of the Borrower and the lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f67a33f5df6562c3788421c933dfc2f1287e8f4e4596bbd09e2b3a2f360ddf57</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RELATED PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A term that refers to individuals and entities closely associated with a given entity, impacting agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Collectively referred to as the parties associated with the Administrative Agent that may have liability to the Borrower, Lender, or other persons under certain circumstances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities affiliated with the Administrative Agent or sub agents entitled to benefits under the terms of the agreement as if they were the Administrative Agent themselves."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities or individuals that have a close business relationship with the Administrative Agent or Lenders and may influence or be influenced by the credit agreement decisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related Parties are entities connected to the Administrative Agent that are involved in decisions or checks regarding loan conditions and borrower relationships."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related Parties are individuals or entities connected to the Indemnified Parties that may also have obligations or liabilities under the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-515a1f26d42a2ffc1dced7e36195ac619bbb7de89e946f61c0ea6dedc03cb138&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1be752fddafadca456c3e43e27d986816dd534c81a0fe1e60a9008d633a048d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf4652b795edde3461b7588a4ea05e72966da5628b2eeae43c81e9d27d9af992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23bd31086495eab78486ce45d76c43d21a87e1a9c5113f67b406aa093affbd09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fc31ef983e1fb2ce3b22784dd6f7b34a4f434eb6a46077483cb44955bbb2668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c5be4b86bb874c0ebcd5df3142d803b7aef8e7c1c715535d330936fe5a0dce9</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEMNIFICATION OBLIGATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Borrower's responsibility to indemnify the Lender and Agent for various taxes and liabilities under the Loan Document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-557ca50e2e7ed07027fe1bc3a3d46b4aca0b92a15a8793019d9d077f72596b84</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 5.01(I)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 5.01(i) outlines the information that the Borrower is required to deliver to the Lenders regarding the Consolidated Group and other related materials."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58c9046d0a5484a6d24c79e57ff3a85f3a4fe99c02f6ce803165f080f36b286b</data>
