  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Parties involved with the Administrative Agent in managing the agreement, including various agents and representatives."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the entities acting on behalf of other parties involved in the loan agreement, typically related to administrative roles."&lt;SEP&gt;"The group that comprises the Administrative Agent and related parties involved in managing the credit agreement."</data>
