<node id="&quot;RESPONSIBLE OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An authorized official of the Borrower who certifies compliance with requirements and responsibilities outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Designated individuals from the Borrower who are responsible for ensuring compliance with the conditions outlined in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific title referring to key executives (such as CEOs or CFOs) applicable to the Borrower in the context of obligation fulfillment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent shall have received one or more certificates of the Borrower signed by a Responsible Officer."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Responsible Officer is a designated individual within the Borrower's organization responsible for certifying various documents related to the transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Responsible Officer is a designated individual within the Borrower’s management responsible for notifying the Administrative Agent about any Defaults or significant financial developments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f1c734d846f35a655ca01c490cae44d5b50d73762de164b96169839717dc150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28b00f9050b45438aaf9a96762d4e5d77883ad3c6c6c0357a69caf07f0abf4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0b256098128c95020c20f34577c7172b60522b7f1b6d5f27dde05471ddb586b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-515a1f26d42a2ffc1dced7e36195ac619bbb7de89e946f61c0ea6dedc03cb138&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-644f37b010df65db1ef78b4233dc4b1dda2518dde20d55002acab8c9c4b9dada&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02cd2de7855a70053b6f42c94faa792dc8fbc29bf53fd9cac8a0dca0ec0751b7</data>
