</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-U.S. LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Non-U.S. Lender is a lender that is not classified as a U.S. person for tax purposes, requiring specific documentation to comply with tax regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"A lender that is not based in the United States and may be entitled to specific tax treatment or reduced rates under certain tax agreements."</data>
