<node id="&quot;VOTING STOCK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SECURITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Securities representing ownership in the Borrower that provide voting rights, crucial for governance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Shares that grant the holder the right to vote on company matters, which may determine control dynamics within the Borrower or its Subsidiaries."&lt;SEP&gt;"The type of stock that grants the owner the right to vote on corporate matters, such as electing the board of directors."</data>
