  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Companies Act, 2014 of Ireland, governing company law and operations within Ireland."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Irish Companies Act is the applicable law that the Borrower must follow regarding corporate actions related to the Takeover Offer."&lt;SEP&gt;"The legal framework governing the operations of companies in Ireland that the Borrower is required to comply with."&lt;SEP&gt;"The legislation governing company law in Ireland, relevant to the conditions outlined in the acquisition process."</data>
