<node id="&quot;STATUTORY RESERVE RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A fraction (expressed as a decimal) established by the Federal Reserve Board related to the maximum reserve percentage applied to Eurocurrency Rate advances."&lt;SEP&gt;"The statutory reserve rate is a regulatory rate used in conjunction with LIBOR to determine the Eurocurrency Rate for interest calculations in advances."</data>
