<node id="&quot;ALLERGAN ACQUISITION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal acquisition event concerning Allergan that may be executed through a Scheme or Takeover Offer, subject to conditions detailed in an agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Allergan Acquisition has the meaning set forth in the recitals hereto."&lt;SEP&gt;"Allergan Acquisition refers to a specific transaction involving the Borrower that impacts its financial statements and metrics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the arrangement concerning the acquisition of Allergan, which includes various financial and strategic terms laid out in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Allergan Acquisition refers to a strategic transaction involving the purchase of Allergan, which includes plans for both a Scheme and a Takeover Offer depending on the method of consummation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Allergan Acquisition refers to the agreement under which the Borrower's obligations and interactions with the Lenders are defined."&lt;SEP&gt;"The acquisition deal involving Allergan, which includes certain conditions that could lead to cancellation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2a55c6b7f04b24ab285d974749d7dffb1b53e9f02ded348a822258c40bd47770&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40d0120536be1b8e96b2f903daf9881c37b0db7176468dc8bbbf490240624e03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c9bd21b64b200eb5b45b32553c4dacfef2d7eae4b803edeb5ad9b275a0824cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0b256098128c95020c20f34577c7172b60522b7f1b6d5f27dde05471ddb586b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8ac583fbb163821277a58e5520f364c8b7ff6b8b1cac5c5f9ecaec9187807f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8f799d61b01f18934ea147ca074e5f3a01f511964c2cab511d835f90610d21b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd234d70236eeaae31d80abc0de9ddf5a611a9d89e71a5bad6c336d9c7d4c8c6</data>
