<node id="&quot;LOAN DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Loan Documents' encompass all written agreements related to the loans, detailing terms, conditions, and obligations of all parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"A collection of documents that outline the terms and conditions of the loan between the Borrower and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documents that outline the terms, rights, and obligations associated with the loan, including provisions for resignation and appointment of successor agents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Formal, legally binding contracts outlining the rights, obligations, and terms between lenders and borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Documents consist of all agreements related to the loans from the lenders to the borrower, which govern the terms of the credit arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to all documents related to the loan, including the primary agreement, guaranties, and amendments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent shall have received a counterpart of this Agreement and the other Loan Documents signed on behalf of each party."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Documents encompass all documents pertaining to the loan transaction, including the main Agreement and any amendments, disclosures, and obligations of the involved parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Documents refer to the collective legal documents associated with the credit arrangement that outline the terms and conditions applicable to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The formal documentation that outlines the terms and conditions of the loan, including actions upon changes in GAAP and the division of assets."&lt;SEP&gt;"The formal, legally binding documents that outline the terms of the loan and are to be delivered by the Borrower as authorized by its governing body."&lt;SEP&gt;"documents that outline the terms and conditions under which the loan is provided, including obligations and rights for the Borrower and lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-75613d643837057320625a58ba941f8502befaca16be62f4c54375e5e369d410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40d0120536be1b8e96b2f903daf9881c37b0db7176468dc8bbbf490240624e03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28b00f9050b45438aaf9a96762d4e5d77883ad3c6c6c0357a69caf07f0abf4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dab0531fa4fcf86f70f5a6e071aafc6b5ff5db2eaa35dfe862105382145767e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1a4b40fb4e1d23fccdbfe49f84af59e707d9fec7e183f7052d6148e7630846b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9596d6913071768b731e90c3fce70fd8e8b7dce447b1bd785f16af66c5018e80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08604dcb4f12561e44bd132e16cc1c7302c5e67025a911d9017ef0fe05c72ff4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02cd2de7855a70053b6f42c94faa792dc8fbc29bf53fd9cac8a0dca0ec0751b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b51600eae536cd47259633337cdac9c729e6dcdfe218308793a634df08bf67a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd234d70236eeaae31d80abc0de9ddf5a611a9d89e71a5bad6c336d9c7d4c8c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c5be4b86bb874c0ebcd5df3142d803b7aef8e7c1c715535d330936fe5a0dce9</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
