  <data key="d1">"A form utilized by Non-U.S. persons to certify that income is effectively connected with a trade or business in the United States."&lt;SEP&gt;"IRS Form W-8ECI is used to document non-U.S. persons' income effectively connected with a U.S. trade or business."</data>
