<node id="&quot;PRINCIPAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL INSTRUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Principal refers to the original sum borrowed by the Borrower from the Lenders, which is to be repaid as defined in the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Principal refers to the original sum of money borrowed under the loan agreement that is subject to repayment by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The original sum of money borrowed, and the basis for interest calculations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of money borrowed or the initial loan amount that the Borrower is obligated to repay."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-45f48aac073454f64321c0cdc25d2c032423f2d9bb3784ae8f741bfbe60eb624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d70cab643a5ecddd1b740e1e4acaa3c84ead62d9e90fb3c04b7381a845ad6613&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-515a1f26d42a2ffc1dced7e36195ac619bbb7de89e946f61c0ea6dedc03cb138&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5101875bbe6af73647ed36abe0f23011cd57aa7a0b2cfc76e2acb7141d4d3d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 2.14&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific clause within the loan agreement that outlines the borrower's responsibilities regarding taxes."&lt;SEP&gt;"In the event that an additional payment is made under Section 2.14(a) or 2.14(c) for the account of any Lender..."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 2.14 describes additional obligations and events that may obligate the Borrower to make payments to the lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-866fe4ac1b993c84e8ec6b0b6c75c0299a953c019bffdef5132359bb147793f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af58029e4df0f8a1b8f418a822a4bb9733084e07cb218e90801e810740e8705b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be7bce265f7668641305b669fcfae3cec84ce21e98d4c457d96cadd73dddfbf0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GUARANTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A 'Guaranty' is a promise made by a guarantor to take responsibility for the borrower's obligations if the borrower defaults."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal agreement completed by a Guarantor to assure the Lender of repayment in case the Borrower defaults on the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b51600eae536cd47259633337cdac9c729e6dcdfe218308793a634df08bf67a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f1c734d846f35a655ca01c490cae44d5b50d73762de164b96169839717dc150</data>
