<node id="&quot;APPLICABLE LENDING OFFICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Applicable Lending Office means, with respect to any Lender, the office of such Lender specified as its 'Applicable Lending Office' or similar concept in its Administrative Questionnaire or in the Assignment and Assumption pursuant to which it became a Lender, or such other office, branch, Subsidiary or affiliate of such Lender as such Lender may from time to time specify to the Borrower and the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The office designated for each Lender to provide its funds for Borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific office of the lender that handles the lending activities, which may be impacted by regulations and commitments to lend."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific office or entity from which the Lender operates, which can affect the loan agreement and relevant taxes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-557ca50e2e7ed07027fe1bc3a3d46b4aca0b92a15a8793019d9d077f72596b84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c304cf98860a9b7cd463eae177e2e2d7d98281b29032cd76ecb286c9b22dcdde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d26991303c01e9d7b44bf8a6408f5ea3b79465b3af06451be946611a033d74d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8ac583fbb163821277a58e5520f364c8b7ff6b8b1cac5c5f9ecaec9187807f6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
