<node id="&quot;SCHEME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A defined arrangement that refers to the specific legal structure under which transactions occur in this context."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal arrangement through which the Allergan Acquisition may be executed, often involving shareholder approval and legal compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal plan or proposal outlined within the legal context pertaining to the credit agreement and its provisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Scheme outlines the Borrower's obligations under the legal framework of the Takeover."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Scheme outlines the framework under which the Allergan Acquisition may occur, detailing the process of merging or acquiring the target entity while ensuring compliance with legal requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Scheme refers to the arrangement under which the Allergan Acquisition takes place, necessitating specific actions by the Borrower and approvals from regulatory bodies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Scheme refers to the structured method through which the Borrower's acquisition of Allergan may be executed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0b256098128c95020c20f34577c7172b60522b7f1b6d5f27dde05471ddb586b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23951530ecee6e7c315772c7d629c8dc076e9c6f9229da70b852f02977d99d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8f799d61b01f18934ea147ca074e5f3a01f511964c2cab511d835f90610d21b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd234d70236eeaae31d80abc0de9ddf5a611a9d89e71a5bad6c336d9c7d4c8c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f8d5bdd05b7cd0d1c2d946f291696266d96f16ce4e2c34eb03dcb8cc207d234&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45657cee66f5d4dc6f4a2c3782e7a948a999592063dc6b41616722284ea13e80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd2f3c18ca40f5744b1fae1009fdd54117d901009e82d32923eeabad1f6473ae</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HEDGE AGREEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Hedge Agreements are financial contracts that the Borrower may engage in to mitigate risk, included in the calculation of Consolidated Interest Expense."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hedge Agreements encompass all transactions related to rate swaps, commodity swaps, credit derivatives, and other similar financial transactions, governed by master agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hedge Agreements refers to contracts determined based upon mid-market or other readily available quotations provided by recognized dealers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f67a33f5df6562c3788421c933dfc2f1287e8f4e4596bbd09e2b3a2f360ddf57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c9bd21b64b200eb5b45b32553c4dacfef2d7eae4b803edeb5ad9b275a0824cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8ac583fbb163821277a58e5520f364c8b7ff6b8b1cac5c5f9ecaec9187807f6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
