<node id="&quot;FATCA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"FATCA stands for the Foreign Account Tax Compliance Act, which aims to prevent tax evasion by U.S. taxpayers by requiring foreign financial institutions to report on foreign assets held by U.S. account holders."&lt;SEP&gt;"for purposes of this Section 2.14, the term 'applicable law' includes FATCA."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-af58029e4df0f8a1b8f418a822a4bb9733084e07cb218e90801e810740e8705b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-750ac8915cdc1e091b22651f034329ee2d71a189874655a3a3f1357281f1f818</data>
