</node>
<node id="&quot;TAKEOVER OFFER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal proposal made to acquire control of the Borrower, typically associated with certain financial conditions and requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"A proposal made by a party to acquire control of another entity, subject to the terms laid out in various connected documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"A proposal made to shareholders of Allergan to acquire shares and gain control of the company, as part of the acquisition process outlined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Takeover Offer is a formal proposal presented by the Borrower to acquire Allergan, specifying terms and conditions of the proposed acquisition."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Takeover Offer is a legally binding intention by the Borrower to acquire shares from the shareholders of Allergan, contingent on certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Takeover Offer is a specific method by which the acquisition of Allergan is intended to be executed as per the arrangement described."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Takeover Offer is referenced in connection with conditions related to the consummation of the Allergan Acquisition."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Takeover Offer refers to an option for the Borrower to opt for a takeover arrangement as described in the Transaction Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The formal proposal under and described in the Transaction Agreement to acquire shares from the shareholders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58c9046d0a5484a6d24c79e57ff3a85f3a4fe99c02f6ce803165f080f36b286b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdfa67546811206c5bc91d4f4c01b35c55878522beb7caefd3c918cc7bb0e4b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eddc25353ee9ca05b2f15a8a75b64381aa496d6afbc99dd68ffaa3c9aedb55d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0b256098128c95020c20f34577c7172b60522b7f1b6d5f27dde05471ddb586b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23951530ecee6e7c315772c7d629c8dc076e9c6f9229da70b852f02977d99d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd2f3c18ca40f5744b1fae1009fdd54117d901009e82d32923eeabad1f6473ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd234d70236eeaae31d80abc0de9ddf5a611a9d89e71a5bad6c336d9c7d4c8c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2951db15aa0742a2d43bdc126f93e2eba8a987444d5ce22c69f3f9840be94c51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78950c530681eb30ebd5dd748958c0ddb8dd93b84a33af76f5beae6548792ae1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RECOGNIZED DEALER&quot;">
