<node id="&quot;TAKEOVER OFFER DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal document outlining the conditions and terms associated with a Takeover Offer as detailed in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal document outlining the terms and conditions under which a takeover is proposed to be executed, relevant to the financial context of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Takeover Offer Document contains all necessary information regarding the Offer made to shareholders or stakeholders in the context of the Allergan Acquisition, ensuring legal validity and clarity."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Takeover Offer Document contains comprehensive details of the offer presented to Allergan's shareholders, including the terms and conditions for the acquisition."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Takeover Offer Document is a formal contract that outlines the terms and conditions of the Takeover Offer by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The document that outlines the conditions of the Takeover Offer as defined in the Transaction Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The document that outlines the terms and conditions of the Takeover Offer related to Allergan Shares."</data>
