<node id="&quot;ADVANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Advances' denote the amounts disbursed by lenders to the borrower, as outlined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Advances pertain to the funds disbursed by the lender(s) to the Borrower as part of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Advances refer to the funds provided to the Borrower, which must be used in compliance with the stipulations of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Advances refer to the funds that are made available to the Borrower under the credit agreement, representing the lender's legally binding promise to provide financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Amounts loaned to the Borrower by the Lenders under the terms specified in the Agreement, representing the actual funds made available for use."&lt;SEP&gt;"Monetary amounts disbursed under the credit agreement that can be converted between different types as specified in the agreement sections."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the amounts of money that may be drawn down under the Transaction Agreement, differentiated into categories like 364-Day Tranche Advances, 3-Year Tranche Advances, and 5-Year Tranche Advances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the funds disbursed by lenders to the borrower as part of the borrowing process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the funds that are advanced by the Lender to the Borrower under the Agreement, which the Borrower is responsible for repaying."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific amounts borrowed under the agreement which the Borrower may not be obligated to repay immediately in connection with certain activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Advances refer to the funds disbursed by the Lender under the terms of the Agreement, which are subject to security interests."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Advances refer to the funds provided by the Lender as part of the loan agreement, where the Lender has a legal obligation to provide funding under specific conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amounts lent by the Lender to the Borrower under the agreement, which may consist of various types of financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amounts owed by the Borrower to the Lender under the terms of the Agreement, including principal and interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amounts owed to each Lender under the Agreement as part of their commitments to fund."&lt;SEP&gt;"The funds provided to the Borrower under this Agreement, ranking equally with other unsecured obligations of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The legally binding promise by lenders to provide financing up to specified amounts under set conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount lent to the borrower that is outstanding at any given time."&lt;SEP&gt;"if any Lender shall obtain any payment on account of the Advances owing to it..."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dece15a26450f3f3b7005a23a1a87b75619c152d1c0c3fb518d24ff11d52843a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-273fad25f21e3733d9bd3b4f4f05c87cc55bb9453212fdf3c7691185ee536587&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1a4b40fb4e1d23fccdbfe49f84af59e707d9fec7e183f7052d6148e7630846b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af58029e4df0f8a1b8f418a822a4bb9733084e07cb218e90801e810740e8705b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddc8ad50c1474639d452ac21cf074a091bed8d9d40db09df3a4b4bd23b32e37c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dab0531fa4fcf86f70f5a6e071aafc6b5ff5db2eaa35dfe862105382145767e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75f1263fe25efcf5e1a778c55ad14ee6ff940f9a9148c8f1d0c8dff83e78bab7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c38a12ba82433270b2fc4359bfa48fd2baab5dad2c61ceb1e29ec15a6475843&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdfa67546811206c5bc91d4f4c01b35c55878522beb7caefd3c918cc7bb0e4b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6994e4a2a327ca8ded0895f6c5bcd792c447ea6bba1255ec52fc3db7ad808b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-515a1f26d42a2ffc1dced7e36195ac619bbb7de89e946f61c0ea6dedc03cb138&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1583e8d86bec46433cba76eeee6ae8e3d0cee281e57ae7251a6206ddbe83f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23bd31086495eab78486ce45d76c43d21a87e1a9c5113f67b406aa093affbd09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c24e69b4e8b42b6f6b510e02c4bf724c6c72f9e44ce2093b3756bf1297429de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f940048c4d5b2bb225205fb7d95deb9809eacaf8b9d8f8727a53a822a960d8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5282522a2e71f8e55b00655f1e0af06643a4a5cfaab99c8f9bd178c35e9ab337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eddc25353ee9ca05b2f15a8a75b64381aa496d6afbc99dd68ffaa3c9aedb55d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5101875bbe6af73647ed36abe0f23011cd57aa7a0b2cfc76e2acb7141d4d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b51600eae536cd47259633337cdac9c729e6dcdfe218308793a634df08bf67a7</data>
