<node id="&quot;DEBT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A general term referring to borrowed money, including various forms of financial obligations like loans and bonds."&lt;SEP&gt;"An obligation of the Borrower that may be retired using funds raised through Borrowed Debt."&lt;SEP&gt;"Debt refers to the Borrower's financial obligations under prior agreements and any relevant financial instruments that are part of the overall credit structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"Debt refers to the borrowed funds that the Borrower is obligated to repay under the terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Debt refers to the financial obligations or amounts due that the Borrower or Significant Subsidiary must repay which can trigger events of default if not honored."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liabilities or amounts owed by the member of the Consolidated Group, specifically referenced in relation to their fair value under accounting standards."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to all indebtedness and obligations of a Person for borrowed money, purchase price deferrals, and other financial commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to amounts owed under various financial obligations, secured by liens or not."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount owed by the Borrower to the Lender, which may also include obligations to any Guarantor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-218e43d49365393bf48168169286d22a5df7ee1b88b398c5561de8f95be5878f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f1c734d846f35a655ca01c490cae44d5b50d73762de164b96169839717dc150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddc8ad50c1474639d452ac21cf074a091bed8d9d40db09df3a4b4bd23b32e37c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdfa67546811206c5bc91d4f4c01b35c55878522beb7caefd3c918cc7bb0e4b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6994e4a2a327ca8ded0895f6c5bcd792c447ea6bba1255ec52fc3db7ad808b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c9bd21b64b200eb5b45b32553c4dacfef2d7eae4b803edeb5ad9b275a0824cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eddc25353ee9ca05b2f15a8a75b64381aa496d6afbc99dd68ffaa3c9aedb55d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08604dcb4f12561e44bd132e16cc1c7302c5e67025a911d9017ef0fe05c72ff4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d70cab643a5ecddd1b740e1e4acaa3c84ead62d9e90fb3c04b7381a845ad6613</data>
