<node id="&quot;BASE RATE ADVANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of borrowing linked to a domestic interest rate benchmark defined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of borrowing that is linked to a base interest rate commonly used as a benchmark for determining loan rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan structure where the interest rate is tied to a specified base rate plus an applicable margin."&lt;SEP&gt;"Base Rate Advances are another type of borrowing method under the Agreement based on a base interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Base Rate Advances are another type of funding under the credit agreement, typically linked to a conventional base interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Base Rate Advances are loans that are made when Eurocurrency Rate Advances cannot adequately reflect the cost of funding."&lt;SEP&gt;"Base Rate Advances refer to loans that are tied to a specific base interest rate used in calculating the financial cost of borrowing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7af28d15bebf0aa3c3c5d3e5c5b05093f378e5f6d86107e87b93c7d9adb5bca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c304cf98860a9b7cd463eae177e2e2d7d98281b29032cd76ecb286c9b22dcdde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7e324da9ca1b1564ebc9a89d11b7e3f3471a27e48cdcb34c0c7216ce61d335f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a70fa6c5f50dc33cf7d4933da334c4321b8fa5279374e7f6cc64694458cdb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8ac583fbb163821277a58e5520f364c8b7ff6b8b1cac5c5f9ecaec9187807f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75f1263fe25efcf5e1a778c55ad14ee6ff940f9a9148c8f1d0c8dff83e78bab7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d736172953986f05ce85f8300a40bec7b10118ae499cda09fcb21daf31749287</data>
