<node id="&quot;TRANSACTION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal contract governing the terms under which the Takeover Offer is made, including specific rights and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal contract that outlines the terms and conditions governing the various aspects of the credit agreement and associated meetings."&lt;SEP&gt;"An agreement that contains significant definitions and provisions related to the main credit terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Transaction Agreement includes terms and conditions establishing obligations for the Borrower and details such as the Cash Consideration for the Allergan Shares."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Transaction Agreement is referenced in relation to the consummation of the Allergan Acquisition and relevant conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Transaction Agreement, dated as of June 25, 2019, defines the contractual relationship between the Borrower, Venice Subsidiary LLC, and Allergan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The agreement governing terms including any cash consideration alterations related to the Allergan Shares."&lt;SEP&gt;"The document outlining the terms and conditions under which the Allergan Acquisition will proceed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The legal document governing the terms of the Allergan Acquisition, detailing the obligations and rights of the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"a specific contract relating to the transaction at hand, including clauses that govern the actions of involved parties."</data>
