<node id="&quot;CLOSING DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Closing Date is the specific date when the loan agreement is finalized and funding is completed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Lender shall provide funds before 1:00 p.m. (Local Time) on the Closing Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Closing Date is when all parties finalize transactions and obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Closing Date marks the specific date on which all parties formally execute the Agreement, initiating its binding terms and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Closing Date refers to the final date by which all conditions must be satisfied for the credit agreement to come into effect."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which all agreed upon terms of the credit agreement are finalized and the loan proceeds are made available to the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which the agreement formally takes effect and the specified funds are made available to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which the agreements are formalized and the contractual obligations begin for the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which the conditions set forth in Section 3.02 of the agreement have been fulfilled or waived."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date that signifies the completion of the agreement and marks the formal commencement of obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The official date upon which all parties have signed and the transaction is finalized."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date marking the formal commencement of contractual obligations associated with the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date on which all applicable parties have signed the agreement, marking the start of contractual obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date when the loan agreement is finalized, marking the beginning of contractual obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7af28d15bebf0aa3c3c5d3e5c5b05093f378e5f6d86107e87b93c7d9adb5bca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c304cf98860a9b7cd463eae177e2e2d7d98281b29032cd76ecb286c9b22dcdde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a55c6b7f04b24ab285d974749d7dffb1b53e9f02ded348a822258c40bd47770&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58c9046d0a5484a6d24c79e57ff3a85f3a4fe99c02f6ce803165f080f36b286b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a4b11d9d570dfb94869367bf658bbf44c8a288c83406b056f2db68067634598&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6fecb6c14e74dc19c2d2c6c0027fa29dee78b526e13ea8a2ff95880d1d5fd24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75613d643837057320625a58ba941f8502befaca16be62f4c54375e5e369d410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3572813e4fb97fffeaa5cf8aa5591bc7eadcda80d2654bfbcfcc30832c77f0bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0b256098128c95020c20f34577c7172b60522b7f1b6d5f27dde05471ddb586b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2277d9071e073b486c921e5a5a70aadfb55298cb8f05fd2067d7a9260f30eded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d70cab643a5ecddd1b740e1e4acaa3c84ead62d9e90fb3c04b7381a845ad6613&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd234d70236eeaae31d80abc0de9ddf5a611a9d89e71a5bad6c336d9c7d4c8c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fc31ef983e1fb2ce3b22784dd6f7b34a4f434eb6a46077483cb44955bbb2668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d736172953986f05ce85f8300a40bec7b10118ae499cda09fcb21daf31749287</data>
