<node id="&quot;TAKEOVER PANEL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Irish Takeover Panel responsible for overseeing the compliance of takeover offers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Takeover Panel is a regulatory authority involved in overseeing aspects of the Scheme and approving necessary actions as per the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Takeover Panel is the authority overseeing compliance with rules regarding disclosures, particularly in relation to the Transactions and confidentiality provisions mentioned in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Takeover Panel is the regulatory authority involved in approving the Takeover Offer Document and overseeing the Takeover Offer process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Takeover Panel oversees regulations affecting debt syndication and ensures compliance with the Takeover Rules during offer periods."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58c9046d0a5484a6d24c79e57ff3a85f3a4fe99c02f6ce803165f080f36b286b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1a4b40fb4e1d23fccdbfe49f84af59e707d9fec7e183f7052d6148e7630846b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23951530ecee6e7c315772c7d629c8dc076e9c6f9229da70b852f02977d99d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea2fcc7ba04310baa44bb49e42022c0e5cae9efe737efd7e3181f2be9502aaf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78950c530681eb30ebd5dd748958c0ddb8dd93b84a33af76f5beae6548792ae1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
