<node id="&quot;PRE-CLOSING FUNDING DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Definition and conditions regarding the pre-closing funding date are provided in Section 3.02."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Pre-Closing Funding Date is critical for the timing of fund disbursement to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date associated with funding the Pre-Closing Funded Amount."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date on which funding is expected to occur prior to the official closing of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date on which the funds are to be made available to the Administrative Agent before the official closing of the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-75613d643837057320625a58ba941f8502befaca16be62f4c54375e5e369d410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0b256098128c95020c20f34577c7172b60522b7f1b6d5f27dde05471ddb586b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0104bff9eb7c543e1a1b6a2643895187b79bfbd66162e3c78746048f7cd71d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd234d70236eeaae31d80abc0de9ddf5a611a9d89e71a5bad6c336d9c7d4c8c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d736172953986f05ce85f8300a40bec7b10118ae499cda09fcb21daf31749287</data>
