</node>
<node id="&quot;ELECTRONIC COMMUNICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GENERAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Methods of communication that include e-mails and other digital forms used for sending notices and other relevant information as outlined in the loan document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-492bd425f44531b53e489ea3b2caba91dc56c30bd67efa35312d27305ba2b45f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The term 'By' is used in legal documents to indicate that a representative is acting on behalf of a company or individual."</data>
