</node>
<node id="&quot;VARIOUS FINANCIAL INSTITUTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Various Financial Institutions are the lenders providing the loan, ensuring the financing arrangement is fulfilled as per the agreement."</data>
