</node>
<node id="&quot;LEVEL 5: LESS THAN LEVEL 4 BUT AT LEAST BBB/BAA2&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A credit rating level indicating significant risk, with margins ranging from 0.375% to 1.375% for applicable tranches."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c01f63bff235f0de4fd04cc572f42b5048f051f30e90ff46450fed63088a2d1e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CERTAIN FUNDS PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A defined time frame in which specific financial conditions apply, particularly regarding defaults and transactional allowances in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specified duration during which certain conditions are applicable to lender commitments and borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"A timeframe during which specific conditions apply to the Borrower's rights regarding assignment consent under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The timeframe defined within the agreement during which certain financial conditions and obligations must be met regarding the Allergan Acquisition."&lt;SEP&gt;"the period during which specific conditions apply to the assignee's eligibility and rights under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2a55c6b7f04b24ab285d974749d7dffb1b53e9f02ded348a822258c40bd47770&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75613d643837057320625a58ba941f8502befaca16be62f4c54375e5e369d410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2277d9071e073b486c921e5a5a70aadfb55298cb8f05fd2067d7a9260f30eded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c24e69b4e8b42b6f6b510e02c4bf724c6c72f9e44ce2093b3756bf1297429de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22981ba75cbdf796a13889f833879f18b5cb8cb79562d8354336d507ba15fd3a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TERM SOFR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The forward-looking term rate based on the SOFR, selected or recommended by the Relevant Governmental Body."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-78950c530681eb30ebd5dd748958c0ddb8dd93b84a33af76f5beae6548792ae1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;KIRKLAND &amp; ELLIS LLP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A law firm that provides a favorable opinion letter in form and substance satisfactory to the Administrative Agent regarding the Borrower's compliance and contractual obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Kirkland &amp; Ellis LLP is indicated as a law firm that serves the borrower, receiving notices related to the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4672811df132c7923e0efdf2626851c0074a173c88eaef0cd035486a60444dd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28b00f9050b45438aaf9a96762d4e5d77883ad3c6c6c0357a69caf07f0abf4e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTRALINKS™&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SYSTEM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An electronic platform mentioned in the loan document for the delivery of notices and other communications among involved parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-492bd425f44531b53e489ea3b2caba91dc56c30bd67efa35312d27305ba2b45f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NAME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Placeholder for an individual or entity whose details will be provided as part of the credit agreement, potentially in a signature line."&lt;SEP&gt;"The placeholder 'Name' typically represents the individual or legal entity responsible for executing the agreement or document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The placeholder for the name of the individual or entity involved in the agreement who is responsible for obligations under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-361b958f400e07b98fe74795bfb9f97f4eb3d5774e3972427afa89d0d4de49e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c497a3192e4849ea19db5f27a1c5c44f052e2edab8a1ce6100cf8f9b7e96875e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c5b84f51c10276a201431b8edfa4bfa215cbf0130bba5e870b2cdd72a44958c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EVENTS OF DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Events of Default outlines specific scenarios wherein the Borrower fails to meet its obligations, potentially resulting in penalties or acceleration of the financial terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Outlines specific conditions under which default may occur, triggering predefined consequences within the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific conditions that, if met, would trigger default provisions within the agreement, necessitating action from lenders and the administrative agent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59856153649b40596d478b3e3da65ad43c5f06c034b24225cd62242ce120ef82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d70cab643a5ecddd1b740e1e4acaa3c84ead62d9e90fb3c04b7381a845ad6613&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49ce2e20687c39f8adb36f4c7eaf5929707be873ec30020c12b3996b15532e8e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEVEL 6: LESS THAN LEVEL 5&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The lowest rating indicating high risk, with margins up to 0.625% to 1.625% for various tranches in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c01f63bff235f0de4fd04cc572f42b5048f051f30e90ff46450fed63088a2d1e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CASH COMPONENT OF THE SCHEME CONSIDERATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the cash payment obligations as part of the acquisition structure that must be fulfilled under the terms of the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2a55c6b7f04b24ab285d974749d7dffb1b53e9f02ded348a822258c40bd47770</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGULATION D&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A regulation that outlines reserve requirements applicable to financial institutions regarding Eurocurrency liabilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-78950c530681eb30ebd5dd748958c0ddb8dd93b84a33af76f5beae6548792ae1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A condition indicating that the Borrower has not fulfilled obligations under the Agreement, which must be certified to not have occurred as of the Effective Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Default indicates the failure of the Borrower to meet obligations specified in the Loan Document, leading to potential actions from the Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Default refers to the failure of the Borrower to meet its contractual obligations, triggering reporting requirements and potential actions as stated in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-644f37b010df65db1ef78b4233dc4b1dda2518dde20d55002acab8c9c4b9dada&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fc31ef983e1fb2ce3b22784dd6f7b34a4f434eb6a46077483cb44955bbb2668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28b00f9050b45438aaf9a96762d4e5d77883ad3c6c6c0357a69caf07f0abf4e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SYNDTRAK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SYSTEM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An electronic system used for facilitating communications regarding the loan document among parties involved."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-492bd425f44531b53e489ea3b2caba91dc56c30bd67efa35312d27305ba2b45f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TITLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Placeholder for the role or designation of an individual signing the credit agreement, indicating their authority to bind the respective parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The placeholder 'Title' refers to the position held by the individual signing the document, indicating their authority to act on behalf of the company or entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"The role/title refers to the position held by the individuals executing the agreement, indicating authority."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-361b958f400e07b98fe74795bfb9f97f4eb3d5774e3972427afa89d0d4de49e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c497a3192e4849ea19db5f27a1c5c44f052e2edab8a1ce6100cf8f9b7e96875e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c5b84f51c10276a201431b8edfa4bfa215cbf0130bba5e870b2cdd72a44958c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPROVED ELECTRONIC PLATFORM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A digital platform that allows for the posting and delivery of communication and documents relevant to the credit agreement between the Borrower, Lenders, and Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Approved Electronic Platform is defined in Section 9.02(c) as a formal electronic mechanism used within the context of this credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42655ae5c10ca5a5455649629ca19df62fdf6ee510c4c866b8072d6acd3b5aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf4652b795edde3461b7588a4ea05e72966da5628b2eeae43c81e9d27d9af992</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SQUEEZE OUT NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A notice given under Chapter 2, Part 9 of the Irish Companies Act issued by the Borrower to an Allergan Shareholder who has not accepted the Takeover Offer."&lt;SEP&gt;"A notice related to the takeover offer that outlines the cash considerations involved in the transaction for minority shareholders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Squeeze Out Notice is a formal notification issued by the Borrower to the remaining shareholders of Allergan signifying the intent to acquire their shares."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2a55c6b7f04b24ab285d974749d7dffb1b53e9f02ded348a822258c40bd47770&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23951530ecee6e7c315772c7d629c8dc076e9c6f9229da70b852f02977d99d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78950c530681eb30ebd5dd748958c0ddb8dd93b84a33af76f5beae6548792ae1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VENICE SUBSIDIARY LLC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Delaware limited liability company mentioned in the context of the Transaction Agreement as one of the parties involved."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5282522a2e71f8e55b00655f1e0af06643a4a5cfaab99c8f9bd178c35e9ab337</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHARTER AND BY-LAWS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The official documents of the Borrower certifying its structure and governance, required on the Effective Date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c28b00f9050b45438aaf9a96762d4e5d77883ad3c6c6c0357a69caf07f0abf4e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLEARPAR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SYSTEM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An additional electronic platform cited in the loan document for sharing notices and communications between involved parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-492bd425f44531b53e489ea3b2caba91dc56c30bd67efa35312d27305ba2b45f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSIGNOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Assignor is the entity transferring its rights and obligations under the Credit Agreement to the Assignee."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Assignor represents and warrants its legal ownership of the Assigned Interest and has full power and authority regarding the execution of the Assignment and Assumption."&lt;SEP&gt;"The party that is transferring its rights or obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The party that originally holds the rights and obligations under the Assignment and Assumption, responsible for payments that have accrued before the Effective Date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-361b958f400e07b98fe74795bfb9f97f4eb3d5774e3972427afa89d0d4de49e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f017c94dcbd47e1b84a1e23aa6ce599d075b32b712dd01a176cb8ce4431a2a80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02df159aa8fd8baa02e06207b25febee2ff6252249087c7ca15d7ccbfb4802d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea2fcc7ba04310baa44bb49e42022c0e5cae9efe737efd7e3181f2be9502aaf6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DUTIES OF ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Details the responsibilities and obligations assigned to the Administrative Agent for managing the agreement's terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-49ce2e20687c39f8adb36f4c7eaf5929707be873ec30020c12b3996b15532e8e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BAIL-IN ACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Bail-In Action refers to the exercise of Write-Down and Conversion Powers by an EEA Resolution Authority pertaining to the liabilities of an EEA Financial Institution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to a procedure allowing a financial institution to restructure its liabilities by converting certain types of debt into equity to stabilize the institution, relevant in the context of credit agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42655ae5c10ca5a5455649629ca19df62fdf6ee510c4c866b8072d6acd3b5aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2532dceb11310f90fe874dcb7a03665b47bca038a4f5360f466bf9fb8d95bca4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSOLIDATED EBITDA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consolidated EBITDA means, for any fiscal period, the Consolidated net income of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries for such period determined in accordance with GAAP plus the following..."&lt;SEP&gt;"Earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation, and amortization calculated for the Borrower, used to assess financial performance against total debt."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6c9bd21b64b200eb5b45b32553c4dacfef2d7eae4b803edeb5ad9b275a0824cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2277d9071e073b486c921e5a5a70aadfb55298cb8f05fd2067d7a9260f30eded</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;364-DAY TRANCHE ADVANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific type of short-term funding mentioned within the context of Advances, available for a 364-day period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5282522a2e71f8e55b00655f1e0af06643a4a5cfaab99c8f9bd178c35e9ab337</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An officer of the Borrower responsible for certifying the resolutions and true signatures of authorized officers related to the Loan Documents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c28b00f9050b45438aaf9a96762d4e5d77883ad3c6c6c0357a69caf07f0abf4e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER MATERIALS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GENERAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Documents and information provided by the Borrower, which may be included or referenced in the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documents and information transmitted by the Borrower that are relevant to the credit agreement and its execution, potentially including confidential information."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bf4652b795edde3461b7588a4ea05e72966da5628b2eeae43c81e9d27d9af992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-492bd425f44531b53e489ea3b2caba91dc56c30bd67efa35312d27305ba2b45f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSIGNEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ASSIGNEE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Assignee is the entity that receives rights and obligations from the Assignor under the Credit Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Assignee represents and warrants its authority and ability to acquire the Assigned Interest and become a Lender under the Credit Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity that receives rights or obligations under the credit agreement through a transfer from the original party, responsible for compliance with laws and procedures related to credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"The party that is receiving the rights or obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The party that receives the rights and obligations from the Assignor under the Assignment and Assumption, responsible for payments that have accrued from and after the Effective Date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e4c21c119b42c3a7bffab2cce7ed7a8ff74cb8c062ed13e11143a7d8e2d6a179&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02df159aa8fd8baa02e06207b25febee2ff6252249087c7ca15d7ccbfb4802d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-361b958f400e07b98fe74795bfb9f97f4eb3d5774e3972427afa89d0d4de49e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f017c94dcbd47e1b84a1e23aa6ce599d075b32b712dd01a176cb8ce4431a2a80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea2fcc7ba04310baa44bb49e42022c0e5cae9efe737efd7e3181f2be9502aaf6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEMNIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A provision outlining the protection offered to the Administrative Agent against potential losses or claims related to their duties."&lt;SEP&gt;"A provision that outlines the Lenders' agreement to indemnify the Administrative Agent against certain liabilities incurred while acting under the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-23bd31086495eab78486ce45d76c43d21a87e1a9c5113f67b406aa093affbd09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49ce2e20687c39f8adb36f4c7eaf5929707be873ec30020c12b3996b15532e8e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BAIL-IN LEGISLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Bail-In Legislation encompasses laws implemented by EEA Member Countries that adhere to Article 55 of Directive 2014/59/EU concerning financial institutions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42655ae5c10ca5a5455649629ca19df62fdf6ee510c4c866b8072d6acd3b5aaf</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSOLIDATED INTEREST EXPENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consolidated Interest Expense means, for any fiscal period, the total interest expense of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries on a Consolidated basis determined in accordance with GAAP."&lt;SEP&gt;"Consolidated Interest Expense signifies total interest expenses for the Borrower and its Subsidiaries on a Consolidated basis according to GAAP."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6c9bd21b64b200eb5b45b32553c4dacfef2d7eae4b803edeb5ad9b275a0824cf</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;3-YEAR TRANCHE ADVANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of funding arrangement under the Transaction Agreement, defined for a duration of three years."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5282522a2e71f8e55b00655f1e0af06643a4a5cfaab99c8f9bd178c35e9ab337</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSISTANT SECRETARY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An officer who assists the Secretary in certifying documents related to the Borrower and its authority to execute the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c28b00f9050b45438aaf9a96762d4e5d77883ad3c6c6c0357a69caf07f0abf4e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUBLIC LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific type of Lender that does not wish to receive material non-public information about the Borrower and its subsidiaries or their respective securities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bf4652b795edde3461b7588a4ea05e72966da5628b2eeae43c81e9d27d9af992</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STANDARD TERMS AND CONDITIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Standard Terms and Conditions represent the agreed provisions that govern the rights and obligations outlined in the Assignment and Assumption."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-02df159aa8fd8baa02e06207b25febee2ff6252249087c7ca15d7ccbfb4802d7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESIGNATION OF ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Conditions and procedures under which the Administrative Agent may resign from their role in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-49ce2e20687c39f8adb36f4c7eaf5929707be873ec30020c12b3996b15532e8e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BASE RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Base Rate is a benchmark interest rate that serves as a starting point for floating rate loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Base Rate is defined as the maximum of several interest rates, including the Prime Rate and NYFRB Rate, affecting the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Base Rate is a key financial term that serves as a reference for determining interest rates within the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Base Rate is used to calculate interest on the loan, based on the Prime Rate, indicating how the interest rate is determined."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d7e324da9ca1b1564ebc9a89d11b7e3f3471a27e48cdcb34c0c7216ce61d335f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f48aac073454f64321c0cdc25d2c032423f2d9bb3784ae8f741bfbe60eb624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42655ae5c10ca5a5455649629ca19df62fdf6ee510c4c866b8072d6acd3b5aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78362831995eec40b3305bc8a7d598334904e9a3e5e4037fec3ad342ec088a9a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSOLIDATED NET INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Consolidated net income refers to the total income of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries as calculated in accordance with GAAP."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6c9bd21b64b200eb5b45b32553c4dacfef2d7eae4b803edeb5ad9b275a0824cf</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;5-YEAR TRANCHE ADVANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Describes a funding option under the Transaction Agreement that is available for a five-year term."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term referencing loans that have a 5-year repayment period, with specific terms for interest and repayment outlined in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5282522a2e71f8e55b00655f1e0af06643a4a5cfaab99c8f9bd178c35e9ab337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7af28d15bebf0aa3c3c5d3e5c5b05093f378e5f6d86107e87b93c7d9adb5bca5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOOD STANDING CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A certificate required indicating that the Borrower is compliant with regulations and is in good standing as of the Effective Date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c28b00f9050b45438aaf9a96762d4e5d77883ad3c6c6c0357a69caf07f0abf4e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal communication indicating that information has been posted to the Approved Electronic Platform, which serves as effective delivery to the Lender under the terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Notice refers to the obligation of the Lender to inform the Borrower after exercising setoff rights as stipulated in the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bf4652b795edde3461b7588a4ea05e72966da5628b2eeae43c81e9d27d9af992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3fd5f2a6fbb9e2996bf6411ed3c5457faf2d2bd6c6bf8b0821ae37e4c465ac6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSIGNED INTEREST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Assigned Interest includes all rights and obligations assigned from the Assignor to the Assignee under the Credit Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Assigned Interest refers to the specific interest in the loan or credit facility being transferred from the Assignor to the Assignee."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-02df159aa8fd8baa02e06207b25febee2ff6252249087c7ca15d7ccbfb4802d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea2fcc7ba04310baa44bb49e42022c0e5cae9efe737efd7e3181f2be9502aaf6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GAAP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"GAAP stands for Generally Accepted Accounting Principles, the accounting standards used to prepare financial statements."&lt;SEP&gt;"GAAP, or Generally Accepted Accounting Principles, are the standard framework of guidelines for financial accounting used by the Borrower to prepare its financial statements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Generally Accepted Accounting Principles relevant to the financial narratives and obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Generally Accepted Accounting Principles, the standard framework of guidelines for financial accounting used in the United States."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-644f37b010df65db1ef78b4233dc4b1dda2518dde20d55002acab8c9c4b9dada&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3572813e4fb97fffeaa5cf8aa5591bc7eadcda80d2654bfbcfcc30832c77f0bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08604dcb4f12561e44bd132e16cc1c7302c5e67025a911d9017ef0fe05c72ff4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c9bd21b64b200eb5b45b32553c4dacfef2d7eae4b803edeb5ad9b275a0824cf</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BASE RATE ADVANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of loan arrangement where advances are based on a predefined base interest rate, particularly relevant in the context of Eurocurrency Rate Advances being converted."&lt;SEP&gt;"Base Rate Advance denotes an amount of money borrowed that incurs interest based on the Base Rate as described in Section 2.07(a)(i) of the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9d26991303c01e9d7b44bf8a6408f5ea3b79465b3af06451be946611a033d74d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42655ae5c10ca5a5455649629ca19df62fdf6ee510c4c866b8072d6acd3b5aaf</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONFIDENTIALITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A provision that ensures the protection of sensitive information shared among parties in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-49ce2e20687c39f8adb36f4c7eaf5929707be873ec30020c12b3996b15532e8e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;U.S. PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DEFINITION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A U.S. Person is defined for tax purposes, requiring certain documentation to exempt them from U.S. federal backup withholding tax."&lt;SEP&gt;"A person or entity that is categorized as a U.S. taxpayer for tax purposes and is engaged in transactions related to U.S. laws and regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to individuals or entities as defined in the Internal Revenue Code, particularly concerning legal status relevant to the Transaction Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5282522a2e71f8e55b00655f1e0af06643a4a5cfaab99c8f9bd178c35e9ab337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-750ac8915cdc1e091b22651f034329ee2d71a189874655a3a3f1357281f1f818&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be7bce265f7668641305b669fcfae3cec84ce21e98d4c457d96cadd73dddfbf0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JURISDICTION OF FORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GEOGRAPHICAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The legal territory or authority under which the Borrower is formed, from which the good standing certificate must be obtained."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c28b00f9050b45438aaf9a96762d4e5d77883ad3c6c6c0357a69caf07f0abf4e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECURITIES LAWS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The laws and regulations governing the issuance and trading of securities, which the parties must comply with in relation to Borrower Materials."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bf4652b795edde3461b7588a4ea05e72966da5628b2eeae43c81e9d27d9af992</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMITMENT/ADVANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the legally binding promise by the lender to provide financing, with specified amounts outlined in the assigned interests and obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e4c21c119b42c3a7bffab2cce7ed7a8ff74cb8c062ed13e11143a7d8e2d6a179</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEBT SYNDICATION DURING THE CERTAIN FUNDS PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the process of syndicating debt obligations among multiple lenders within a specified timeframe during the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-49ce2e20687c39f8adb36f4c7eaf5929707be873ec30020c12b3996b15532e8e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BENCHMARK REPLACEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Benchmark Replacement describes an alternative benchmark interest rate selected by the Administrative Agent and the Borrower, reflecting the transition away from LIBOR in credit agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Replacement pursuant to this Section 2.20 will occur prior to the applicable Benchmark Transition Start Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Benchmark Replacement refers to the alternative interest rate that replaces LIBOR in financial agreements, established by relevant government bodies or through prevailing market conventions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial reference point used for interest calculations, which can be adjusted under specific circumstances in relation to the Transaction Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5282522a2e71f8e55b00655f1e0af06643a4a5cfaab99c8f9bd178c35e9ab337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42655ae5c10ca5a5455649629ca19df62fdf6ee510c4c866b8072d6acd3b5aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02cd2de7855a70053b6f42c94faa792dc8fbc29bf53fd9cac8a0dca0ec0751b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78362831995eec40b3305bc8a7d598334904e9a3e5e4037fec3ad342ec088a9a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MINORITY INTEREST EXPENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL METRIC"</data>
  <data key="d1">"minority interest expense refers to the portion of income attributed to minority shareholders in the subsidiaries of the Borrower, affecting Consolidated EBITDA calculations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6c9bd21b64b200eb5b45b32553c4dacfef2d7eae4b803edeb5ad9b275a0824cf</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WITHDRAWAL LIABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DEFINITION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A liability that may arise under specific circumstances defined by ERISA, which could be relevant to the parties of the Transaction Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial obligation that an employer incurs when it withdraws from a Multiemployer Plan, potentially impacting their financial standing and commitments in a credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5282522a2e71f8e55b00655f1e0af06643a4a5cfaab99c8f9bd178c35e9ab337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0ed6d0a7062e2fb3635c3defcdbad07963741b071cdc36d7c4b34749a2e718a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUSINESS DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Business Days refer to the standard days in which business operations occur, impacting the timelines for performance obligations mentioned in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Days on which business is typically conducted, referenced in the context of providing notification periods within the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Days that are typically recognized as working days for businesses, used in the context of determining the timing of notice effectiveness."&lt;SEP&gt;"The time frame required prior to the Effective Date for certain documentation to be provided by the Borrower to the Administrative Agent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-492bd425f44531b53e489ea3b2caba91dc56c30bd67efa35312d27305ba2b45f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd234d70236eeaae31d80abc0de9ddf5a611a9d89e71a5bad6c336d9c7d4c8c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28b00f9050b45438aaf9a96762d4e5d77883ad3c6c6c0357a69caf07f0abf4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d70cab643a5ecddd1b740e1e4acaa3c84ead62d9e90fb3c04b7381a845ad6613</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEMNIFIED PARTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Indemnified Party refers to the entity or person presumed not to have any liability except in specific situations such as gross negligence or misconduct."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indemnified Parties are entities that are provided additional assurance by the Borrower against claims, damages, losses, penalties, liabilities, and expenses that may arise in connection to the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a1be752fddafadca456c3e43e27d986816dd534c81a0fe1e60a9008d633a048d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3fd5f2a6fbb9e2996bf6411ed3c5457faf2d2bd6c6bf8b0821ae37e4c465ac6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGGREGATE AMOUNT OF COMMITMENT/ADVANCES OF ASSIGNOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The total amount that the Assignor is entitled to under the credit agreement, illustrating the financial obligations assigned and their specified amounts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e4c21c119b42c3a7bffab2cce7ed7a8ff74cb8c062ed13e11143a7d8e2d6a179</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOVERNING LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Determines the legal jurisdiction under which the credit agreement will be interpreted and enforced."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-49ce2e20687c39f8adb36f4c7eaf5929707be873ec30020c12b3996b15532e8e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BENCHMARK REPLACEMENT ADJUSTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Benchmark Replacement Adjustment concerns a spread adjustment applicable when replacing LIBOR, foundational for determining interest rates for credit facilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42655ae5c10ca5a5455649629ca19df62fdf6ee510c4c866b8072d6acd3b5aaf</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXTRAORDINARY OR UNUSUAL CHARGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL METRIC"</data>
  <data key="d1">"extraordinary or unusual charges represent non-recurring expenses that are included in the calculation of Consolidated EBITDA."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6c9bd21b64b200eb5b45b32553c4dacfef2d7eae4b803edeb5ad9b275a0824cf</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WRITE-DOWN AND CONVERSION POWERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DEFINITION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Describes the authority held by EEA Resolution Authorities over financial instruments, which may impact agreements between the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the powers that allow the resolution of unsecured liabilities by an EEA Resolution Authority, affecting how liabilities under the agreement may be handled."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific powers exercised by EEA Resolution Authority related to the modification of liability terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5282522a2e71f8e55b00655f1e0af06643a4a5cfaab99c8f9bd178c35e9ab337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-245f24acd98603313a2446a8d5a32f7a192d4383d71b7f423ff6fdab962825e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2bfe906a99dc77a8d4ae5a8cc5d7410e85fbdbb82f47beec1071bdf4298102</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGULATORY AUTHORITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Entities responsible for enforcing compliance concerning anti-money laundering and other regulations applicable to the Borrower and the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c28b00f9050b45438aaf9a96762d4e5d77883ad3c6c6c0357a69caf07f0abf4e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOSSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Losses are defined as any claims, damages, losses, penalties, liabilities, and expenses that may be incurred by or asserted against any Indemnified Party in connection with the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a1be752fddafadca456c3e43e27d986816dd534c81a0fe1e60a9008d633a048d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AMOUNT OF COMMITMENT/ADVANCES ASSIGNED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The specific sum of money being transferred by the Assignor to the Assignee, reflecting the distribution of financial commitments in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e4c21c119b42c3a7bffab2cce7ed7a8ff74cb8c062ed13e11143a7d8e2d6a179</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AMENDMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to changes or modifications made to the existing terms of the credit agreement, as outlined in Section 9.01."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-49ce2e20687c39f8adb36f4c7eaf5929707be873ec30020c12b3996b15532e8e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EEA RESOLUTION AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Authority responsible for overseeing the resolution of financial institutions within the European Economic Area and exercising powers related to liability management."&lt;SEP&gt;"EEA Resolution Authority refers to the regulatory body with the power to enact Write-Down and Conversion Powers for EEA Financial Institutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"any public administrative authority or Person entrusted with public administrative authority of any EEA Member Country responsible for the resolution of any EEA Financial Institution."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-22981ba75cbdf796a13889f833879f18b5cb8cb79562d8354336d507ba15fd3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42655ae5c10ca5a5455649629ca19df62fdf6ee510c4c866b8072d6acd3b5aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2bfe906a99dc77a8d4ae5a8cc5d7410e85fbdbb82f47beec1071bdf4298102</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-CASH STOCK OPTION EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL METRIC"</data>
  <data key="d1">"non-cash stock option expenses refer to the costs associated with stock options granted to employees, also included in Consolidated EBITDA calculations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6c9bd21b64b200eb5b45b32553c4dacfef2d7eae4b803edeb5ad9b275a0824cf</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TYPE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DEFINITION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to categorization of interest rate types applicable under the Transaction Agreement, such as Base Rate Advance or Eurocurrency Rate Advance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5282522a2e71f8e55b00655f1e0af06643a4a5cfaab99c8f9bd178c35e9ab337</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OPINION LETTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal document issued by Kirkland &amp; Ellis LLP that assesses legal aspects and compliance concerning the Borrower’s obligations under the Loan Documents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c28b00f9050b45438aaf9a96762d4e5d77883ad3c6c6c0357a69caf07f0abf4e</data>
