</node>
<node id="&quot;CLAIMS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Claims refer to any asserted legal demands that may arise in connection with the Agreement, for which the Borrower may need to indemnify the Indemnified Parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a1be752fddafadca456c3e43e27d986816dd534c81a0fe1e60a9008d633a048d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERCENTAGE ASSIGNED OF ASSIGNOR’S COMMITMENT/ADVANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The proportion of the total Commitment/Advances assigned from the Assignor to the Assignee, typically expressed as a percentage to delineate shares of financial responsibility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e4c21c119b42c3a7bffab2cce7ed7a8ff74cb8c062ed13e11143a7d8e2d6a179</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MORGAN STANLEY SENIOR FUNDING, INC.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial institution serving as the Administrative Agent in the context of credit agreements, responsible for managing administrative tasks and coordinating among syndicate lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"MORGAN STANLEY SENIOR FUNDING, INC. is serving as the Administrative Agent in the context of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Morgan Stanley Senior Funding, Inc. acts as the Administrative Agent responsible for making all payments in respect of the Assigned Interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"Morgan Stanley Senior Funding, Inc. acts as the Administrative Agent under the Credit Agreement, managing obligations related to the transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Morgan Stanley Senior Funding, Inc. acts as the Administrative Agent, managing the operational aspects of the Term Loan Credit Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Morgan Stanley Senior Funding, Inc. acts as the administrative agent under the credit agreement, coordinating loan operations and communication."&lt;SEP&gt;"Morgan Stanley Senior Funding, Inc. also takes on the role of Administrative Agent, managing the operational aspects and communication among the participating lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Morgan Stanley Senior Funding, Inc. is one of the lenders engaged in the credit agreement, with specified loan commitments detailed in the schedule."&lt;SEP&gt;"Morgan Stanley Senior Funding, Inc. serves as the Administrative Agent for the lenders involved in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The administrative agent for the Bridge Facility, facilitating the management and coordination between the Borrower and lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The administrative agent for the Lenders involved in the Term Loan Credit Agreement, responsible for managing the loan arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The designated Administrative Agent appointed by the Lenders to manage the administrative tasks associated with the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4672811df132c7923e0efdf2626851c0074a173c88eaef0cd035486a60444dd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6fecb6c14e74dc19c2d2c6c0027fa29dee78b526e13ea8a2ff95880d1d5fd24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6870421eef25f276c9b4cba8d0469f540f802084dfdb8efab466f2e3625629f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a70fa6c5f50dc33cf7d4933da334c4321b8fa5279374e7f6cc64694458cdb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6994e4a2a327ca8ded0895f6c5bcd792c447ea6bba1255ec52fc3db7ad808b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4c21c119b42c3a7bffab2cce7ed7a8ff74cb8c062ed13e11143a7d8e2d6a179&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0acc60f8a909dc9fb1cf54a1cf46218765eaf98dfc26d26b6f7432172f07047a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02df159aa8fd8baa02e06207b25febee2ff6252249087c7ca15d7ccbfb4802d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7493bb66f0421335c6ef87034d49cf6bf9d3d02f08284e06abb442b159d239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea2fcc7ba04310baa44bb49e42022c0e5cae9efe737efd7e3181f2be9502aaf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c5b84f51c10276a201431b8edfa4bfa215cbf0130bba5e870b2cdd72a44958c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NO WAIVER; REMEDIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A provision that explicitly states that the lender's failure to enforce any rights under the agreement does not result in a waiver of their rights."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-49ce2e20687c39f8adb36f4c7eaf5929707be873ec30020c12b3996b15532e8e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EEA FINANCIAL INSTITUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"EEA Financial Institution is a type of financial entity operating within the European Economic Area that is subject to Bail-In Actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"any financial institution established in an EEA Member Country that is subject to consolidated supervision with its parent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-22981ba75cbdf796a13889f833879f18b5cb8cb79562d8354336d507ba15fd3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42655ae5c10ca5a5455649629ca19df62fdf6ee510c4c866b8072d6acd3b5aaf</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSOLIDATED LEVERAGE RATIO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL METRIC"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A ratio described in the agreement that measures the Borrower's total debt relative to its EBITDA, used for compliance with financial covenants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Consolidated Leverage Ratio measures the Borrower's debt levels relative to its EBITDA, as set forth in Section 5.03(a) of the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6c9bd21b64b200eb5b45b32553c4dacfef2d7eae4b803edeb5ad9b275a0824cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2277d9071e073b486c921e5a5a70aadfb55298cb8f05fd2067d7a9260f30eded</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 1.03&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The section outlining various definitions and responsibilities related to the calculation of covenants in light of potential changes in GAAP and other regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-08604dcb4f12561e44bd132e16cc1c7302c5e67025a911d9017ef0fe05c72ff4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OFFER PRESS ANNOUNCEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Offer Press Announcement serves to communicate the initiation of the Takeover Offer to the public and relevant stakeholders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0b256098128c95020c20f34577c7172b60522b7f1b6d5f27dde05471ddb586b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEMNIFIED PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Indemnified Parties are the entities that the Borrower agrees to protect against certain liabilities as outlined in the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a1be752fddafadca456c3e43e27d986816dd534c81a0fe1e60a9008d633a048d</data>
