</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPLETED ADMINISTRATIVE QUESTIONNAIRE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A form that the Assignee must provide to Morgan Stanley Senior Funding, Inc. indicating credit contacts for information exchange and compliance with applicable laws."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e4c21c119b42c3a7bffab2cce7ed7a8ff74cb8c062ed13e11143a7d8e2d6a179</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BOFA SECURITIES, INC.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"BofA Securities, Inc. aids in the coordination and distribution processes of the funds associated with the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"BofA Securities, Inc. is listed as a Joint Lead Arranger and Joint Bookrunner, facilitating the distribution of the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d6870421eef25f276c9b4cba8d0469f540f802084dfdb8efab466f2e3625629f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COSTS AND EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Costs and Expenses refer to the obligations agreed upon by the Borrower to pay all reasonable and documented out-of-pocket costs related to the preparation and execution of the Agreement and associated documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Details the obligations related to the payment of costs and expenses incurred in the enforcement of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a1be752fddafadca456c3e43e27d986816dd534c81a0fe1e60a9008d633a048d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49ce2e20687c39f8adb36f4c7eaf5929707be873ec30020c12b3996b15532e8e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRIME RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Prime Rate is one of the benchmarks used to determine the Base Rate, representing the interest rate banks charge their most creditworthy customers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The rate of interest last quoted by The Wall Street Journal as the 'Prime Rate' in the U.S. It reflects the highest per annum interest rate for loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42655ae5c10ca5a5455649629ca19df62fdf6ee510c4c866b8072d6acd3b5aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be2493d0103919c27e88c4d44795e6271de20e61d113f608a0e09b6a8035e77e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSOLIDATED NET ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DEFINITION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial measure used to evaluate the Borrower's total assets after liabilities, relevant for determining the limits on secured Borrowed Debt."&lt;SEP&gt;"Represents the total value of assets held by the Consolidated Group, excluding certain financial obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The aggregate amount of assets after deducting all current liabilities, as set forth on the Consolidated balance sheet of the Consolidated Group."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddc8ad50c1474639d452ac21cf074a091bed8d9d40db09df3a4b4bd23b32e37c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be2493d0103919c27e88c4d44795e6271de20e61d113f608a0e09b6a8035e77e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f1c734d846f35a655ca01c490cae44d5b50d73762de164b96169839717dc150</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 1.04&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The section that provides definitions of terms and their application within the context of the entire agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-08604dcb4f12561e44bd132e16cc1c7302c5e67025a911d9017ef0fe05c72ff4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CERTAIN FUNDS REPRESENTATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Certain Funds Representations include assurances provided by the Borrower regarding the status of their financial condition and related obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d0b256098128c95020c20f34577c7172b60522b7f1b6d5f27dde05471ddb586b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COUNSEL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Counsel refers to the legal advisors involved in the preparation and enforcement of the Agreement, often representing the Indemnified Parties and other related entities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a1be752fddafadca456c3e43e27d986816dd534c81a0fe1e60a9008d633a048d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CREDIT CONTACTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Individuals designated by the Assignee to receive syndicate-level financial information, ensuring that communications conform to legal standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e4c21c119b42c3a7bffab2cce7ed7a8ff74cb8c062ed13e11143a7d8e2d6a179</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ABBVIE INC.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Delaware corporation that is the Borrower in this Term Loan Credit Agreement, responsible for financing the acquisition of Allergan and repaying the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal business entity involved in the legal proceedings, as disclosed in their Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q."&lt;SEP&gt;"ABBVIE INC. is identified as the Company in the text, indicating it is a legal business entity engaged in a commercial activity."&lt;SEP&gt;"ABBVIE INC. is identified as the Company under the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"ABBVIE INC. is the primary entity receiving funds under the Term Loan Credit Agreement, responsible for repaying the loan according to agreed terms, including interest and fees."&lt;SEP&gt;"AbbVie Inc. is identified as the Borrower within the context of this credit agreement, responsible for repayment according to its terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"AbbVie Inc. is identified as the borrower within the context of the credit agreement, responsible for fulfilling the terms outlined, including repayment obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"AbbVie Inc. is the entity referred to as the 'Company' in the Term Loan Credit Agreement, responsible for making borrowing requests under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4672811df132c7923e0efdf2626851c0074a173c88eaef0cd035486a60444dd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43fd98c686173eacd61526672255759598710d3a4f18a04f5a2857c63619e722&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6870421eef25f276c9b4cba8d0469f540f802084dfdb8efab466f2e3625629f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a70fa6c5f50dc33cf7d4933da334c4321b8fa5279374e7f6cc64694458cdb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c497a3192e4849ea19db5f27a1c5c44f052e2edab8a1ce6100cf8f9b7e96875e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02df159aa8fd8baa02e06207b25febee2ff6252249087c7ca15d7ccbfb4802d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7493bb66f0421335c6ef87034d49cf6bf9d3d02f08284e06abb442b159d239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c5b84f51c10276a201431b8edfa4bfa215cbf0130bba5e870b2cdd72a44958c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RIGHT OF SETOFF&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Establishes the lender's right to seize funds from the borrower's accounts in the event of default."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-49ce2e20687c39f8adb36f4c7eaf5929707be873ec30020c12b3996b15532e8e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NYFRB RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A reference interest rate utilized for calculating interest owed under the agreement, based on federal funds transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference rate set by the New York Federal Reserve Bank, used to determine the cost of funds for Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"NYFRB Rate is another benchmark similar to the Prime Rate used in calculating the Base Rate for loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The NYFRB Rate is the interest rate applied to amounts distributed to the Lenders if the Borrower fails to make a timely payment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cdfa67546811206c5bc91d4f4c01b35c55878522beb7caefd3c918cc7bb0e4b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f48aac073454f64321c0cdc25d2c032423f2d9bb3784ae8f741bfbe60eb624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42655ae5c10ca5a5455649629ca19df62fdf6ee510c4c866b8072d6acd3b5aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fc4d08c3313588875690a6e3517754dd273e5008229a9650ffc8862e6d0c261</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSOLIDATED TOTAL DEBT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DEFINITION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The aggregate principal amount of Borrowed Debt of the Borrower and its Subsidiaries determined on a Consolidated basis as of such date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of debt held by the Borrower, considered for financial covenants defined in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddc8ad50c1474639d452ac21cf074a091bed8d9d40db09df3a4b4bd23b32e37c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2277d9071e073b486c921e5a5a70aadfb55298cb8f05fd2067d7a9260f30eded</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 1.05&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The section addressing the treatment of divisions or restructuring of entities under the loan agreement and their implications for obligations and assets."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-08604dcb4f12561e44bd132e16cc1c7302c5e67025a911d9017ef0fe05c72ff4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SCHEME DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Documents related to the Scheme that outline its terms, conditions, and legal requirements for the acquisition process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Scheme Documents are formal documents that outline the terms and conditions of the proposed Allergan Acquisition, ensuring that all information is accurate and reflects the obligations of the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Scheme Documents are part of the conditions under which the Allergan Acquisition must be assessed, as mentioned in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The documents that detail the obligations and terms of the Scheme to which the Borrower must comply."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bd234d70236eeaae31d80abc0de9ddf5a611a9d89e71a5bad6c336d9c7d4c8c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2951db15aa0742a2d43bdc126f93e2eba8a987444d5ce22c69f3f9840be94c51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f8d5bdd05b7cd0d1c2d946f291696266d96f16ce4e2c34eb03dcb8cc207d234&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8f799d61b01f18934ea147ca074e5f3a01f511964c2cab511d835f90610d21b</data>
