  <data key="d1">"MUFG Bank, Ltd. facilitates the process of loan syndication and ensures proper handling of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"MUFG Bank, Ltd. is involved in the lending commitments detailed in the credit agreement, providing financial resources."&lt;SEP&gt;"MUFG Bank, Ltd. serves as the Syndication Agent, involved in the arrangement and coordination of the loan among multiple lenders."</data>
