</node>
<node id="&quot;EUROCURRENCY RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A benchmark interest rate used to set rates on Eurocurrency loans, which can be adjusted based on economic factors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eurocurrency Rate acts as a base reference point for calculating interest rates on Eurocurrency Rate Advances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eurocurrency Rate is a reference interest rate used in the Base Rate calculation, reflecting rates for currency deposits in international markets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eurocurrency Rate is a reference used to determine interest rates for loans denominated in foreign currencies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interest rate associated with Eurocurrency loans, determining the cost of borrowing for the Advances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d7e324da9ca1b1564ebc9a89d11b7e3f3471a27e48cdcb34c0c7216ce61d335f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d26991303c01e9d7b44bf8a6408f5ea3b79465b3af06451be946611a033d74d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fc4d08c3313588875690a6e3517754dd273e5008229a9650ffc8862e6d0c261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42655ae5c10ca5a5455649629ca19df62fdf6ee510c4c866b8072d6acd3b5aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f67a33f5df6562c3788421c933dfc2f1287e8f4e4596bbd09e2b3a2f360ddf57</data>
