<node id="&quot;INTEREST PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A defined period in which a specific interest rate, such as LIBOR, is applied to advances in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Interest Period is a defined time frame that impacts the calculation of interest on Eurocurrency Rate Advances under the terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Period defines the time frame for which interest is calculated on Eurocurrency Rate Advances, dictating the terms of repayment during that time."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Period refers to the duration for which the interest rate is applied to the Eurocurrency Rate Advance and can vary from one week to six months."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Period refers to the set timeframe over which interest is calculated on borrowed amounts according to the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Period refers to the specific timeline applied to interest calculations, such as every three months as mentioned in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Interest Period indicates the timeframe over which interest is calculated and paid under the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Interest Period is the timeframe within which interest accrues on the borrowed principal as outlined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The defined period for which interest is calculated on certain types of advances under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The defined timeframe during which interest calculations are made for Eurocurrency Rate Advances."&lt;SEP&gt;"The initial timeframe specified for the interest calculation on each Advance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7af28d15bebf0aa3c3c5d3e5c5b05093f378e5f6d86107e87b93c7d9adb5bca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c304cf98860a9b7cd463eae177e2e2d7d98281b29032cd76ecb286c9b22dcdde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7e324da9ca1b1564ebc9a89d11b7e3f3471a27e48cdcb34c0c7216ce61d335f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a70fa6c5f50dc33cf7d4933da334c4321b8fa5279374e7f6cc64694458cdb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6994e4a2a327ca8ded0895f6c5bcd792c447ea6bba1255ec52fc3db7ad808b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59856153649b40596d478b3e3da65ad43c5f06c034b24225cd62242ce120ef82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42655ae5c10ca5a5455649629ca19df62fdf6ee510c4c866b8072d6acd3b5aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f67a33f5df6562c3788421c933dfc2f1287e8f4e4596bbd09e2b3a2f360ddf57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75f1263fe25efcf5e1a778c55ad14ee6ff940f9a9148c8f1d0c8dff83e78bab7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78362831995eec40b3305bc8a7d598334904e9a3e5e4037fec3ad342ec088a9a</data>
