  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Screen Rate is the published rate used to determine the Eurocurrency Rate for a specific Interest Period."&lt;SEP&gt;"The predetermined rates provided through market mechanisms, used to establish the Interpolated Rate during the Impact Interest Period."</data>
