<node id="&quot;BARCLAYS BANK PLC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Barclays Bank PLC participates as a Documentation Agent, ensuring the legal documentation of the loan is managed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Barclays Bank PLC participates in the lending commitments, signifying its involvement in the credit arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Barclays Bank PLC supports the administration and documentation of the loan for compliance and agreement enforcement."</data>
