</node>
<node id="&quot;JURISDICTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Defines the specific court systems that would have jurisdiction over legal proceedings related to the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The legal authority under which the Lender or Agent operates, impacting the taxation and legal obligations concerning the Loan Document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-557ca50e2e7ed07027fe1bc3a3d46b4aca0b92a15a8793019d9d077f72596b84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49ce2e20687c39f8adb36f4c7eaf5929707be873ec30020c12b3996b15532e8e</data>
