</node>
<node id="&quot;INTERPOLATED RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A rate determined by the Administrative Agent through a linear interpolation method based on available Screen Rates for the Impacted Interest Period."&lt;SEP&gt;"A temporary interest rate used during an Impact Interest Period when LIBOR is unavailable, ensuring continuity in interest rate calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interpolated Rate is a method used when adequate means for ascertaining the Eurocurrency Rate do not exist, adjusting interest rates accordingly."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interpolated Rate is an estimated interest rate used when the Screen Rate is unavailable for calculating the Eurocurrency Rate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-59856153649b40596d478b3e3da65ad43c5f06c034b24225cd62242ce120ef82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7e324da9ca1b1564ebc9a89d11b7e3f3471a27e48cdcb34c0c7216ce61d335f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42655ae5c10ca5a5455649629ca19df62fdf6ee510c4c866b8072d6acd3b5aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40d0120536be1b8e96b2f903daf9881c37b0db7176468dc8bbbf490240624e03</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COURT MEETING RESOLUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DEFINITION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Defined under the Transaction Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Resolutions that must be approved at the Court Meeting for contractual agreements to proceed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddc8ad50c1474639d452ac21cf074a091bed8d9d40db09df3a4b4bd23b32e37c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40d0120536be1b8e96b2f903daf9881c37b0db7176468dc8bbbf490240624e03</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AMOUNTS AND TERMS OF THE ADVANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The section outlining the specifics regarding the advances provided under the credit agreement, including amounts and terms associated with those advances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-08604dcb4f12561e44bd132e16cc1c7302c5e67025a911d9017ef0fe05c72ff4</data>
