</node>
<node id="&quot;COUNTERPARTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the multiple copies in which the Assignment and Assumption may be executed, ensuring that together they form one instrument."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f017c94dcbd47e1b84a1e23aa6ce599d075b32b712dd01a176cb8ce4431a2a80</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PATRIOT ACT NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A provision notifying parties of compliance obligations under the Patriot Act regarding financial transactions."</data>
