</node>
<node id="&quot;BNP PARIBAS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"BNP Paribas ensures that the documentation of the credit agreement adheres to regulatory standards and requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"BNP Paribas is a Documentation Agent responsible for the oversight of legal processes associated with the Term Loan Credit Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"BNP Paribas is identified as a lender involved in the credit agreement's total loan commitments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d6870421eef25f276c9b4cba8d0469f540f802084dfdb8efab466f2e3625629f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0acc60f8a909dc9fb1cf54a1cf46218765eaf98dfc26d26b6f7432172f07047a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNADJUSTED BENCHMARK REPLACEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Unadjusted Benchmark Replacement refers to the interest rate benchmark that substitutes LIBOR, used for U.S. dollar-denominated syndicated credit facilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Unadjusted Benchmark Replacement refers to the rate replacing LIBOR that does not include an adjustment spread."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42655ae5c10ca5a5455649629ca19df62fdf6ee510c4c866b8072d6acd3b5aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78362831995eec40b3305bc8a7d598334904e9a3e5e4037fec3ad342ec088a9a</data>
