</node>
<node id="&quot;COURT ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A directive from a court related to the approval or conditions required for the Allergan Acquisition, affirming compliance with applicable laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal order issued by the court relevant to the oversight and compliance of the Scheme."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal order issued by the court that may affect the terms or conditions of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Defined under the Transaction Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ddc8ad50c1474639d452ac21cf074a091bed8d9d40db09df3a4b4bd23b32e37c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd234d70236eeaae31d80abc0de9ddf5a611a9d89e71a5bad6c336d9c7d4c8c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f8d5bdd05b7cd0d1c2d946f291696266d96f16ce4e2c34eb03dcb8cc207d234&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd2f3c18ca40f5744b1fae1009fdd54117d901009e82d32923eeabad1f6473ae</data>
