</node>
<node id="&quot;TRANCHE COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Each Lender's Tranche Commitment represents the maximum amount of funds they are willing to lend to the Borrower, varied by the term of the Tranche."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d736172953986f05ce85f8300a40bec7b10118ae499cda09fcb21daf31749287</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENTITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Agents or the Lenders in this Agreement refer to financial institutions engaged in the provision of loans under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dab0531fa4fcf86f70f5a6e071aafc6b5ff5db2eaa35dfe862105382145767e3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSIGNMENT AND ASSUMPTION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The formal document signed by parties involved in an assignment that delineates the rights and obligations being assigned among the parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7c38a12ba82433270b2fc4359bfa48fd2baab5dad2c61ceb1e29ec15a6475843</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELECTRONIC SIGNATURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The method by which the Assignor and Assignee accept and adopt the terms of the Assignment and Assumption, considered as effective as a manual signature."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f017c94dcbd47e1b84a1e23aa6ce599d075b32b712dd01a176cb8ce4431a2a80</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CITIBANK, N.A.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"CitiBank, N.A. is recognized as a lender in the credit agreement, contributing to the overall financing package."&lt;SEP&gt;"Citibank, N.A. also acts as a Documentation Agent in the context of facilitating and managing the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Citibank, N.A. participates in documentation management, ensuring that all relevant paperwork for the loan is accurately maintained."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d6870421eef25f276c9b4cba8d0469f540f802084dfdb8efab466f2e3625629f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0acc60f8a909dc9fb1cf54a1cf46218765eaf98dfc26d26b6f7432172f07047a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NO ADVISORY OR FIDUCIARY RESPONSIBILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clarifies that the lender does not have a fiduciary obligation towards the borrower under the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-49ce2e20687c39f8adb36f4c7eaf5929707be873ec30020c12b3996b15532e8e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIBOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A widely used benchmark interest rate in global financial markets, subject to replacement in the event of benchmark transition."&lt;SEP&gt;"LIBOR (London Interbank Offered Rate) is a benchmark interest rate that some lenders use as a reference for determining the interest rates on loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"LIBOR is an interest rate benchmark that has historically been used for calculating the loans' interest rates in credit agreements. It serves as a reference rate for financial transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reference interest rate used as a benchmark for certain loans, included in the definitions of the Eurocurrency Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The London interbank offered rate (LIBOR) used for determining interest rates in various credit agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-866fe4ac1b993c84e8ec6b0b6c75c0299a953c019bffdef5132359bb147793f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40d0120536be1b8e96b2f903daf9881c37b0db7176468dc8bbbf490240624e03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6994e4a2a327ca8ded0895f6c5bcd792c447ea6bba1255ec52fc3db7ad808b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59856153649b40596d478b3e3da65ad43c5f06c034b24225cd62242ce120ef82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78362831995eec40b3305bc8a7d598334904e9a3e5e4037fec3ad342ec088a9a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEBT ISSUANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The incurrence of Borrowed Debt by the Borrower or any other member of the Consolidated Group, excluding certain types of borrowings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-218e43d49365393bf48168169286d22a5df7ee1b88b398c5561de8f95be5878f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRE-CLOSING FUNDING ELECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A decision made prior to the closing date concerning the funding of advances to the Borrower, affecting the terms of the disbursement by Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"If a Pre-Closing Funding Election has been made, subject solely to the satisfaction of the required conditions set forth in Section 3.02, each Lender shall, before 1:00 p.m. on the proposed date of Borrowing fund into the Pre-Closing Funding Account."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Pre-Closing Funding Election allows AbbVie Inc. to request funding under the specified terms before the formal closing date of the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c304cf98860a9b7cd463eae177e2e2d7d98281b29032cd76ecb286c9b22dcdde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d736172953986f05ce85f8300a40bec7b10118ae499cda09fcb21daf31749287&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a70fa6c5f50dc33cf7d4933da334c4321b8fa5279374e7f6cc64694458cdb0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROJECTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Projections are estimates and forecasts made by the Borrower regarding future financial performance shared with the Lenders prior to the Effective Date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dab0531fa4fcf86f70f5a6e071aafc6b5ff5db2eaa35dfe862105382145767e3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The contractual responsibilities that the Borrower must fulfill under the terms of the Agreement, as well as those of the Lenders and administrative agents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligations refer to the specific duties and responsibilities that the Borrower must fulfill as stipulated in the Agreement, ensuring compliance with financial and operational standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-273fad25f21e3733d9bd3b4f4f05c87cc55bb9453212fdf3c7691185ee536587&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14dc72f1acf50414a477c2db2c796ddbbd61a6a79ce8e689f589c7f4fe13c8f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TELECOPY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A means of delivering the executed counterpart of the Assignment and Assumption to ensure compliance with contract execution."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f017c94dcbd47e1b84a1e23aa6ce599d075b32b712dd01a176cb8ce4431a2a80</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HSBC BANK USA, N.A.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"HSBC Bank USA, N.A. is involved as a Documentation Agent, ensuring compliance and proper documentation within the credit arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"HSBC Bank USA, N.A. is involved in the documentation processes, guaranteeing that ABBVIE INC.'s obligations are documented correctly."&lt;SEP&gt;"HSBC Bank USA, N.A. is listed among the lenders in the credit agreement, contributing to the total funding provided to the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d6870421eef25f276c9b4cba8d0469f540f802084dfdb8efab466f2e3625629f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0acc60f8a909dc9fb1cf54a1cf46218765eaf98dfc26d26b6f7432172f07047a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTICE OF BORROWING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal notification indicating the Borrower's request for funds, which becomes binding under specified conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal notification provided by the Borrower to the Administrative Agent detailing the request for funds on a specified date."&lt;SEP&gt;"A notification sent to the Administrative Agent from the Borrower detailing their intent to borrow funds as specified in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An important communication that must comply with specific sections of the credit agreement when the Borrower seeks to draw funds."&lt;SEP&gt;"Document that proposes the date of Borrowing and other related terms, which must comply with the Pre-Closing Funding Election."&lt;SEP&gt;"Form of Notice of Borrowing is referenced as part of the credit agreement documentation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c304cf98860a9b7cd463eae177e2e2d7d98281b29032cd76ecb286c9b22dcdde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdfa67546811206c5bc91d4f4c01b35c55878522beb7caefd3c918cc7bb0e4b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fc4d08c3313588875690a6e3517754dd273e5008229a9650ffc8862e6d0c261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc2bd6d38a427261506e79c61e760df7064ed466412b69e938b252fe5e96bd95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd234d70236eeaae31d80abc0de9ddf5a611a9d89e71a5bad6c336d9c7d4c8c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d736172953986f05ce85f8300a40bec7b10118ae499cda09fcb21daf31749287</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BENCHMARK REPLACEMENT DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Administrative Agent will notify the Borrower and the Lenders of any related Benchmark Replacement Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which a new benchmark replaces an existing one, particularly with respect to LIBOR in this context."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date on which the new benchmark replaces LIBOR as defined in the agreement after a benchmark transition event occurs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6994e4a2a327ca8ded0895f6c5bcd792c447ea6bba1255ec52fc3db7ad808b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02cd2de7855a70053b6f42c94faa792dc8fbc29bf53fd9cac8a0dca0ec0751b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78362831995eec40b3305bc8a7d598334904e9a3e5e4037fec3ad342ec088a9a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFAULT INTEREST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Default Interest' is the increased interest rate applied when the borrower fails to fulfill their payment obligations on time."&lt;SEP&gt;"A higher interest rate applied when the borrower fails to meet payment obligations, as a penalty."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'Default Interest' is an additional rate of interest applied if the borrower fails to meet repayment obligations, serving as a penalty."&lt;SEP&gt;"Upon the occurrence and during the continuance of an Event of Default, the borrower must pay Default Interest, which is a higher interest applied on overdue principal amounts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-218e43d49365393bf48168169286d22a5df7ee1b88b398c5561de8f95be5878f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7e324da9ca1b1564ebc9a89d11b7e3f3471a27e48cdcb34c0c7216ce61d335f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b51600eae536cd47259633337cdac9c729e6dcdfe218308793a634df08bf67a7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EUROCURRENCY RATE ADVANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial term indicating advances provided based on international interest rates, understandable in the context of currency transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A form of financing that relies on the Eurocurrency rate, which can be converted into a base rate advance when conditions warrant."&lt;SEP&gt;"A loan structure where the interest rate is tied to a Eurocurrency benchmark rate, with a margin added."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of borrowing that is subjected to interest rates based on international benchmarks."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan specified within the credit agreement based on Eurocurrency rates, subject to certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eurocurrency Rate Advances are a type of funding under the credit agreement, typically involving loans that are based on the Eurocurrency market rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eurocurrency Rate Advances are types of loans made available to the borrower with interest tied to a floating Eurocurrency Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eurocurrency Rate Advances refer to a type of borrowing under the Agreement that is based on the Eurocurrency interest rates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7af28d15bebf0aa3c3c5d3e5c5b05093f378e5f6d86107e87b93c7d9adb5bca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c304cf98860a9b7cd463eae177e2e2d7d98281b29032cd76ecb286c9b22dcdde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7e324da9ca1b1564ebc9a89d11b7e3f3471a27e48cdcb34c0c7216ce61d335f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a70fa6c5f50dc33cf7d4933da334c4321b8fa5279374e7f6cc64694458cdb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d26991303c01e9d7b44bf8a6408f5ea3b79465b3af06451be946611a033d74d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fc4d08c3313588875690a6e3517754dd273e5008229a9650ffc8862e6d0c261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75f1263fe25efcf5e1a778c55ad14ee6ff940f9a9148c8f1d0c8dff83e78bab7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d736172953986f05ce85f8300a40bec7b10118ae499cda09fcb21daf31749287</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSOLIDATED SUBSIDIARIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Consolidated Subsidiaries are companies under the Borrower's control, significant for their financial positioning as it pertains to the Borrower's obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dab0531fa4fcf86f70f5a6e071aafc6b5ff5db2eaa35dfe862105382145767e3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTICIPATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Participation indicates the involvement of multiple Lenders in the financing arrangement, allowing them to share the risks and benefits associated with the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c14dc72f1acf50414a477c2db2c796ddbbd61a6a79ce8e689f589c7f4fe13c8f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GENERAL PROVISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Specific promises regarding the binding nature and execution of the Assignment and Assumption among the parties involved."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f017c94dcbd47e1b84a1e23aa6ce599d075b32b712dd01a176cb8ce4431a2a80</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;$6,000,000,000&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMOUNT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The total amount of the Term Loan Credit Agreement, indicating the sum to be borrowed by ABBVIE INC."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d6870421eef25f276c9b4cba8d0469f540f802084dfdb8efab466f2e3625629f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSIGNMENT AND ASSUMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal document executed by an assigning Lender and an assignee representing that it is an Eligible Assignee, facilitating the transfer of rights or obligations under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal, legally binding contract outlining the rights, obligations, and terms between the Assignor and Assignee regarding the payments of principal, interest, fees and other amounts related to the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal document that facilitates the transfer of rights or obligations from one party to another within the credit agreement framework."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assignment and Assumption is a legal provision that allows for the transfer of rights and obligations from one party to another within the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assignment and Assumption refers to a formal contract entered into by a Lender and an Eligible Assignee, accepted by the Administrative Agent, to transfer rights and obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Form of Assignment and Assumption is referenced as part of the credit agreement documentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The terms set forth in this Assignment and Assumption are hereby agreed to."&lt;SEP&gt;"The terms under which a Lender can transfer rights and obligations to another party, as detailed in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"This Assignment and Assumption dated as of the Effective Date sets forth the terms under which the Assignor assigns its rights and obligations to the Assignee under the Credit Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to the formal document by which assignments are executed between the Lender and the assignee or among parties, establishing their respective rights and obligations under the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-273fad25f21e3733d9bd3b4f4f05c87cc55bb9453212fdf3c7691185ee536587&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc2bd6d38a427261506e79c61e760df7064ed466412b69e938b252fe5e96bd95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5101875bbe6af73647ed36abe0f23011cd57aa7a0b2cfc76e2acb7141d4d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f48aac073454f64321c0cdc25d2c032423f2d9bb3784ae8f741bfbe60eb624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42655ae5c10ca5a5455649629ca19df62fdf6ee510c4c866b8072d6acd3b5aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02df159aa8fd8baa02e06207b25febee2ff6252249087c7ca15d7ccbfb4802d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-361b958f400e07b98fe74795bfb9f97f4eb3d5774e3972427afa89d0d4de49e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f017c94dcbd47e1b84a1e23aa6ce599d075b32b712dd01a176cb8ce4431a2a80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c38a12ba82433270b2fc4359bfa48fd2baab5dad2c61ceb1e29ec15a6475843&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c587e6b1345a423983f8f8f9bdc79596cc74be7c5d91c1332688e48263c116a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BENCHMARK TRANSITION EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Benchmark Transition Event triggers the need for an amendment to the agreement to replace an existing reference rate, illustrating changes in market conditions or benchmarks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Administrative Agent will promptly notify the Borrower and the Lenders of any occurrence of a Benchmark Transition Event."&lt;SEP&gt;"An event that triggers the transition from one benchmark to another, impacting the applicable interest rates and terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The event that triggers the transition from LIBOR to a benchmark replacement, which may include various announcements or public statements by regulatory bodies or the LIBOR administrator."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-866fe4ac1b993c84e8ec6b0b6c75c0299a953c019bffdef5132359bb147793f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6994e4a2a327ca8ded0895f6c5bcd792c447ea6bba1255ec52fc3db7ad808b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02cd2de7855a70053b6f42c94faa792dc8fbc29bf53fd9cac8a0dca0ec0751b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78362831995eec40b3305bc8a7d598334904e9a3e5e4037fec3ad342ec088a9a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Defaulting Lender refers to a lender that has failed to meet its funding obligations as specified in the agreement, potentially affecting loan advances and payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Lender that has failed to meet its contractual obligations under the credit agreement, leading to restrictions on its rights and benefits."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Lender that has failed to meet its obligations under the credit agreement, which triggers specific assignment conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A lender that fails to fulfill its obligations under the agreement, resulting in automatic removal as Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"A lender that fails to meet its funding obligations under the credit agreement, making it necessary to determine the conditions for default."&lt;SEP&gt;"A lender that fails to meet its obligations under the credit agreement, which may affect the payments and commitments of other lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any lender whose commitment or advances are excluded when determining Required 364-Day Tranche Lenders and other required lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to a lender that has failed to comply with the terms of the agreement, particularly regarding the availability of financing or repayment obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Subject to Section 2.18 in the case of a Defaulting Lender, if any Lender shall obtain any payment..."&lt;SEP&gt;"a lender that has failed to meet its obligations under the terms of the agreement, affecting eligibility as an Eligible Assignee."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7af28d15bebf0aa3c3c5d3e5c5b05093f378e5f6d86107e87b93c7d9adb5bca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-218e43d49365393bf48168169286d22a5df7ee1b88b398c5561de8f95be5878f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af58029e4df0f8a1b8f418a822a4bb9733084e07cb218e90801e810740e8705b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a4b11d9d570dfb94869367bf658bbf44c8a288c83406b056f2db68067634598&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-866fe4ac1b993c84e8ec6b0b6c75c0299a953c019bffdef5132359bb147793f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-515a1f26d42a2ffc1dced7e36195ac619bbb7de89e946f61c0ea6dedc03cb138&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5101875bbe6af73647ed36abe0f23011cd57aa7a0b2cfc76e2acb7141d4d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c24e69b4e8b42b6f6b510e02c4bf724c6c72f9e44ce2093b3756bf1297429de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22981ba75cbdf796a13889f833879f18b5cb8cb79562d8354336d507ba15fd3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c5be4b86bb874c0ebcd5df3142d803b7aef8e7c1c715535d330936fe5a0dce9</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUSINESS DAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Business Day is defined as a day on which financial institutions are generally open for business, affecting the timing for notices and transactions in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Business Day is defined in the Agreement as a day on which financial institutions are open for business, determining the timing of transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Business Day refers to any day on which financial institutions are open for business, affecting the timing of payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"A calendar day on which business is conducted, relevant for determining the timeline for notices and advances."&lt;SEP&gt;"A day on which business is conducted according to the Agreement, which affects timelines for actions such as executing assignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"A day on which financial institutions are open and transactions can take place, typically governed by the agreement's terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"A day on which standard business operations are conducted, excluding weekends and holidays, relevant for terms related to notifications and actions required under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the days relevant for executing transactions under the credit agreement, particularly in relation to currency conversions and payment obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the operational days during which actions such as funding can occur, with specific times mentioned for funding actions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7af28d15bebf0aa3c3c5d3e5c5b05093f378e5f6d86107e87b93c7d9adb5bca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c304cf98860a9b7cd463eae177e2e2d7d98281b29032cd76ecb286c9b22dcdde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a4b11d9d570dfb94869367bf658bbf44c8a288c83406b056f2db68067634598&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a70fa6c5f50dc33cf7d4933da334c4321b8fa5279374e7f6cc64694458cdb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c38a12ba82433270b2fc4359bfa48fd2baab5dad2c61ceb1e29ec15a6475843&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f48aac073454f64321c0cdc25d2c032423f2d9bb3784ae8f741bfbe60eb624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75f1263fe25efcf5e1a778c55ad14ee6ff940f9a9148c8f1d0c8dff83e78bab7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-245f24acd98603313a2446a8d5a32f7a192d4383d71b7f423ff6fdab962825e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d736172953986f05ce85f8300a40bec7b10118ae499cda09fcb21daf31749287</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
