<node id="&quot;RELEVANT GOVERNMENTAL BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Relevant Governmental Body is the authority that recommends the spread adjustment or method for calculating such adjustments when replacing LIBOR with a new benchmark."&lt;SEP&gt;"The authority that selects or recommends the Term SOFR rate in financial transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-78362831995eec40b3305bc8a7d598334904e9a3e5e4037fec3ad342ec088a9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78950c530681eb30ebd5dd748958c0ddb8dd93b84a33af76f5beae6548792ae1</data>
