<node id="&quot;LIEN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LIEN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal right or claim against a borrower's asset, granted to the lender as security for the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal right or claim against the borrower's asset that secures the repayment of Debt."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any security interest or charge that provides a lender the right to claim an asset to satisfy a debt, ensuring collateral is in place."&lt;SEP&gt;"a legal claim or right against the Borrower's assets, ensuring the lender can recover funds if the Borrower defaults as specified in the security agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9596d6913071768b731e90c3fce70fd8e8b7dce447b1bd785f16af66c5018e80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-218e43d49365393bf48168169286d22a5df7ee1b88b398c5561de8f95be5878f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40d0120536be1b8e96b2f903daf9881c37b0db7176468dc8bbbf490240624e03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f1c734d846f35a655ca01c490cae44d5b50d73762de164b96169839717dc150</data>
