<node id="&quot;CURRENT REPORT ON FORM 8-K&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Current Report on Form 8-K discloses material events that must be reported promptly, serving as a tool for regulatory compliance pertinent to the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dab0531fa4fcf86f70f5a6e071aafc6b5ff5db2eaa35dfe862105382145767e3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FEDERAL RESERVE BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A regulatory institution that may be involved with the Lender's obligations, particularly regarding the securing of obligations through a security interest under the regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1a4b40fb4e1d23fccdbfe49f84af59e707d9fec7e183f7052d6148e7630846b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMITMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Commitments' refer to the legally binding promises made by lenders to provide specific amounts of financing to the borrower under the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each party’s obligations under this Section 2.14 shall survive the resignation or replacement of the Administrative Agent or any assignment of rights by, or the replacement of, a Lender, the termination of the Commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender's legally binding promise to provide financing under the terms of the credit agreement, indicating the amount and conditions for disbursement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders' legally binding promises to provide funds under specified conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations by the lenders that are legally binding, specified in relation to the agreements outlined."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 2.05 discusses the termination or reduction of the commitments associated with the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitments outlined in the Agreement signify the Lender's legally binding promise to provide financing up to a specified amount."&lt;SEP&gt;"The legally binding promises by lenders to provide a specified amount of financing to the borrower under agreed conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The legally binding promises made by the Lenders to provide financing under specified conditions to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The legally binding promises to provide financing under specified terms in the Transaction Agreement, including categorization into different Tranche Commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The lender's legally binding promise to provide financing to the borrower under specified conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7af28d15bebf0aa3c3c5d3e5c5b05093f378e5f6d86107e87b93c7d9adb5bca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af58029e4df0f8a1b8f418a822a4bb9733084e07cb218e90801e810740e8705b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a4b11d9d570dfb94869367bf658bbf44c8a288c83406b056f2db68067634598&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f940048c4d5b2bb225205fb7d95deb9809eacaf8b9d8f8727a53a822a960d8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5282522a2e71f8e55b00655f1e0af06643a4a5cfaab99c8f9bd178c35e9ab337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75613d643837057320625a58ba941f8502befaca16be62f4c54375e5e369d410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-515a1f26d42a2ffc1dced7e36195ac619bbb7de89e946f61c0ea6dedc03cb138&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0104bff9eb7c543e1a1b6a2643895187b79bfbd66162e3c78746048f7cd71d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b51600eae536cd47259633337cdac9c729e6dcdfe218308793a634df08bf67a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23bd31086495eab78486ce45d76c43d21a87e1a9c5113f67b406aa093affbd09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd234d70236eeaae31d80abc0de9ddf5a611a9d89e71a5bad6c336d9c7d4c8c6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FORM OF ASSIGNMENT AND ASSUMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
