  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWED DEBT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Borrowed Debt refers to any debt obligations incurred by Allergan or its Subsidiaries that require a guarantee under this agreement when they exceed a specified amount."&lt;SEP&gt;"Debt incurred by the Borrower or any member of the Consolidated Group, which may be associated with financial activities outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Debt that is obtained by the Borrower under the terms outlined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to any debt incurred through borrowing money, including loans and other debt instruments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amount of money borrowed by the Borrower that may be secured by a lien on the domestic property or shares."&lt;SEP&gt;"refers to the loans taken by the Borrower that are to be repaid as per the loan agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-218e43d49365393bf48168169286d22a5df7ee1b88b398c5561de8f95be5878f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f1c734d846f35a655ca01c490cae44d5b50d73762de164b96169839717dc150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdfa67546811206c5bc91d4f4c01b35c55878522beb7caefd3c918cc7bb0e4b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eddc25353ee9ca05b2f15a8a75b64381aa496d6afbc99dd68ffaa3c9aedb55d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6994e4a2a327ca8ded0895f6c5bcd792c447ea6bba1255ec52fc3db7ad808b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9596d6913071768b731e90c3fce70fd8e8b7dce447b1bd785f16af66c5018e80</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEBTOR RELIEF LAWS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Laws governing the rights and protections available to borrowers facing insolvency or bankruptcy."</data>
