  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Account into which the Pre-Closing Funded Amount shall be funded by each Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"An account held by the Administrative Agent or its affiliate, used for managing funding prior to the closing of the deal."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c304cf98860a9b7cd463eae177e2e2d7d98281b29032cd76ecb286c9b22dcdde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fc4d08c3313588875690a6e3517754dd273e5008229a9650ffc8862e6d0c261</data>
