<node id="&quot;PARTICIPANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Participants refer to the parties involved in the Agreement who may hold rights or obligations, including assignees or anyone engaged in swap or derivative transactions referenced in the text."</data>
