</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEREST RATE DETERMINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 2.08 specifies the processes for determining the interest rates applicable to the advances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f0104bff9eb7c543e1a1b6a2643895187b79bfbd66162e3c78746048f7cd71d0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ALLERGAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A corporate entity referenced in the Indenture concerning its existing indebtedness as of the Closing Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"A corporation that is a party in the Transaction Agreement, indicating its involvement in the financing arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A member of the Consolidated Group mentioned as engaging in business activities on the Effective Date and the Closing Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Allergan is an Irish public limited company with registered number 527629 having its registered office at Clonshaugh Business &amp; Technology Park, Coolock, Dublin 17 E400, Ireland."&lt;SEP&gt;"Allergan is identified as the target of the acquisition and is responsible for ensuring compliance with various legal and financial obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Allergan is the target company whose shares are subject to the Takeover Offer and involves compliance with regulatory obligations and shareholder interactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Allergan, referenced in the context of financial statements and obligations related to the Borrower, is a significant entity in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liens on property (including that of Allergan and its Subsidiaries), shares of stock or Borrowed Debt existing at the time of acquisition thereof."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is under obligations related to the Scheme and its compliance with the Irish Companies Act and Takeover Rules."&lt;SEP&gt;"The company being acquired by AbbVie Inc. under the terms of the Agreement, subject to the Scheme or Takeover Offer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5282522a2e71f8e55b00655f1e0af06643a4a5cfaab99c8f9bd178c35e9ab337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3572813e4fb97fffeaa5cf8aa5591bc7eadcda80d2654bfbcfcc30832c77f0bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eddc25353ee9ca05b2f15a8a75b64381aa496d6afbc99dd68ffaa3c9aedb55d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dab0531fa4fcf86f70f5a6e071aafc6b5ff5db2eaa35dfe862105382145767e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8ac583fbb163821277a58e5520f364c8b7ff6b8b1cac5c5f9ecaec9187807f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23951530ecee6e7c315772c7d629c8dc076e9c6f9229da70b852f02977d99d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9596d6913071768b731e90c3fce70fd8e8b7dce447b1bd785f16af66c5018e80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2277d9071e073b486c921e5a5a70aadfb55298cb8f05fd2067d7a9260f30eded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7493bb66f0421335c6ef87034d49cf6bf9d3d02f08284e06abb442b159d239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f8d5bdd05b7cd0d1c2d946f291696266d96f16ce4e2c34eb03dcb8cc207d234</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EARLY OPT-IN ELECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A provision in the credit agreement allowing for the adoption of a new benchmark interest rate to replace LIBOR, contingent on the action of the Administrative Agent and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"A provision that allows for an early opt-in to changes concerning benchmark rates and their replacements within the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Early Opt-in Election is a provision allowing lenders to opt into a modified interest rate calculation process, as part of the amendment to the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2532dceb11310f90fe874dcb7a03665b47bca038a4f5360f466bf9fb8d95bca4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-866fe4ac1b993c84e8ec6b0b6c75c0299a953c019bffdef5132359bb147793f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6994e4a2a327ca8ded0895f6c5bcd792c447ea6bba1255ec52fc3db7ad808b90</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EVENT OF DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A situation where the Borrower fails to meet the terms of the Agreement, which affects the assignment consent requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific condition defined in the agreement that allows lenders to act without borrower consent, often resulting from failure to meet obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific condition relating to the Borrower that, if not rectified, may trigger significant consequences under the Agreement, vital to confirm non-occurrence on the Effective Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Event of Default is a situation defined in the agreement that triggers the obligation of the Borrower to pay higher Default Interest rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conditions defined within the agreement that trigger failure of representation or warranty, impacting the Borrower's obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Event of Default signifies a situation that may allow the Lender to demand immediate repayment as defined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific conditions or occurrences defined in the agreement that, if triggered, would constitute a default."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific events or circumstances defined in the agreement that trigger the possibility of acceleration of the loan repayment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-218e43d49365393bf48168169286d22a5df7ee1b88b398c5561de8f95be5878f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7e324da9ca1b1564ebc9a89d11b7e3f3471a27e48cdcb34c0c7216ce61d335f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6fecb6c14e74dc19c2d2c6c0027fa29dee78b526e13ea8a2ff95880d1d5fd24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28b00f9050b45438aaf9a96762d4e5d77883ad3c6c6c0357a69caf07f0abf4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1583e8d86bec46433cba76eeee6ae8e3d0cee281e57ae7251a6206ddbe83f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3fd5f2a6fbb9e2996bf6411ed3c5457faf2d2bd6c6bf8b0821ae37e4c465ac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c24e69b4e8b42b6f6b510e02c4bf724c6c72f9e44ce2093b3756bf1297429de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c5be4b86bb874c0ebcd5df3142d803b7aef8e7c1c715535d330936fe5a0dce9</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 3.02&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to specific contractual clauses detailing conditions required by the Lenders, impacting the funding process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c304cf98860a9b7cd463eae177e2e2d7d98281b29032cd76ecb286c9b22dcdde</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL LAWS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Environmental Laws encompass statutes and regulations that the Borrower must comply with, particularly as they relate to the Borrower's operational practices and impacts on the environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Laws that govern environmental practices and compliance, which can impact the operations and financial risks of the Consolidated Group."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f0ed6d0a7062e2fb3635c3defcdbad07963741b071cdc36d7c4b34749a2e718a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8f799d61b01f18934ea147ca074e5f3a01f511964c2cab511d835f90610d21b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STATE OF NEW YORK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"JURISDICTION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The legal jurisdiction under which this Assignment and Assumption shall be governed and construed."&lt;SEP&gt;"This Agreement shall be governed by, and construed in accordance with, the laws of the State of New York."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f017c94dcbd47e1b84a1e23aa6ce599d075b32b712dd01a176cb8ce4431a2a80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2951db15aa0742a2d43bdc126f93e2eba8a987444d5ce22c69f3f9840be94c51</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COVENANTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Covenants are specific promises made by the Borrower in the agreement, outlining its responsibilities such as compliance with laws and payment of taxes, intended to protect the interests of the lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sections 5.01 and 5.02 detail the affirmative and negative covenants that the borrower must adhere to under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific promises or restrictions included in the agreement that govern the borrower's operations and financial behavior to protect the lender's interests."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-73be087e93080f9e436892b7d182df66394bc79dbf5df119d9357df61b1ebbfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0104bff9eb7c543e1a1b6a2643895187b79bfbd66162e3c78746048f7cd71d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8f799d61b01f18934ea147ca074e5f3a01f511964c2cab511d835f90610d21b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TERM FACILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific financing arrangement outlined in the credit agreement as referenced in the recitals."&lt;SEP&gt;"A structured loan facility consisting of multiple term loan tranches designed to fund the acquisition and associated costs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8b7493bb66f0421335c6ef87034d49cf6bf9d3d02f08284e06abb442b159d239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78950c530681eb30ebd5dd748958c0ddb8dd93b84a33af76f5beae6548792ae1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REQUIRED LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Required Lenders' are those lenders whose approval is necessary for certain actions defined in the agreement, such as amendments or waivers."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific group of lenders whose approval is necessary for amendments or agreements regarding changes in covenants or loan terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any determination or decision made by the Required Lenders with the consent of the Borrower will be conclusive and binding absent manifest error."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders holding more than 50% of the unused Commitments and aggregate outstanding principal amount of Advances at any time."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders that collectively hold a majority or a significant portion of the loan commitment, whose collective decisions impact the administration and operations of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders whose authorization is required for certain actions under the agreement, reflecting their obligations toward the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Required Lenders are a specific group of lenders that must consent to actions taken by the Administrative Agent, influencing decision-making within the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Required Lenders are those lenders that have voting authority, often involved in decisions related to the agreement and its payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Required Lenders refers to a specific group of lenders that must give consent for amendments or actions as outlined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Required Lenders refers to the group of lenders whose consent is necessary for certain actions or decisions in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Required Lenders have authority in waiving conditions precedent that allows the Borrower to proceed with funding."&lt;SEP&gt;"The group of Lenders who hold the necessary authority to make certain decisions outlined in the credit agreement, particularly during significant actions like Early Opt-in Elections."&lt;SEP&gt;"The group of Lenders whose consent is required for amendments or waivers under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The lenders that must consent to certain actions or changes within the terms of the credit agreement, such as a Benchmark Transition Event."&lt;SEP&gt;"The necessary group of lenders who have the authority to appoint a successor Administrative Agent and make decisions affecting the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific group of lenders whose approval is necessary for certain actions to be taken by the Administrative Agent under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Those lenders whose satisfaction or waiver is necessary for the Pre-Closing Funding Election."&lt;SEP&gt;"lenders that must approve certain actions related to the Borrower, including mergers and acquisitions as stated in the loan agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d7e324da9ca1b1564ebc9a89d11b7e3f3471a27e48cdcb34c0c7216ce61d335f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c304cf98860a9b7cd463eae177e2e2d7d98281b29032cd76ecb286c9b22dcdde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2532dceb11310f90fe874dcb7a03665b47bca038a4f5360f466bf9fb8d95bca4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6fecb6c14e74dc19c2d2c6c0027fa29dee78b526e13ea8a2ff95880d1d5fd24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d26991303c01e9d7b44bf8a6408f5ea3b79465b3af06451be946611a033d74d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-866fe4ac1b993c84e8ec6b0b6c75c0299a953c019bffdef5132359bb147793f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6994e4a2a327ca8ded0895f6c5bcd792c447ea6bba1255ec52fc3db7ad808b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-515a1f26d42a2ffc1dced7e36195ac619bbb7de89e946f61c0ea6dedc03cb138&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5101875bbe6af73647ed36abe0f23011cd57aa7a0b2cfc76e2acb7141d4d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0b256098128c95020c20f34577c7172b60522b7f1b6d5f27dde05471ddb586b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9596d6913071768b731e90c3fce70fd8e8b7dce447b1bd785f16af66c5018e80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1583e8d86bec46433cba76eeee6ae8e3d0cee281e57ae7251a6206ddbe83f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08604dcb4f12561e44bd132e16cc1c7302c5e67025a911d9017ef0fe05c72ff4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02cd2de7855a70053b6f42c94faa792dc8fbc29bf53fd9cac8a0dca0ec0751b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b51600eae536cd47259633337cdac9c729e6dcdfe218308793a634df08bf67a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3fd5f2a6fbb9e2996bf6411ed3c5457faf2d2bd6c6bf8b0821ae37e4c465ac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fc31ef983e1fb2ce3b22784dd6f7b34a4f434eb6a46077483cb44955bbb2668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c5be4b86bb874c0ebcd5df3142d803b7aef8e7c1c715535d330936fe5a0dce9</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEBTOR RELIEF LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Debtor Relief Law encompasses legal frameworks that govern the processes available to Borrowers facing financial hardships or insolvency."&lt;SEP&gt;"Debtor Relief Law encompasses regulations that prevent actions against borrowers that may violate their legal rights or lead to forfeiture of assets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to laws that provide relief to debtors, which can include bankruptcy laws and related legal proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4fc31ef983e1fb2ce3b22784dd6f7b34a4f434eb6a46077483cb44955bbb2668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2532dceb11310f90fe874dcb7a03665b47bca038a4f5360f466bf9fb8d95bca4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d70cab643a5ecddd1b740e1e4acaa3c84ead62d9e90fb3c04b7381a845ad6613</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
