<node id="&quot;3-YEAR TRANCHE LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Lender that possesses a 3-Year Tranche Commitment or has a 3-Year Tranche Advance under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that provides a 3-Year Tranche Advance to the Borrower under the terms outlined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each 3-Year Tranche Lender severally and not jointly agrees, to advance same day funds denominated in Dollars to the Administrative Agent on the Pre-Closing Funding Date."</data>
