<node id="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">The "AGREEMENT" is defined as a formal, legally binding contract that establishes the terms and conditions between the Borrower, Lenders, and other involved parties, including Agents. This comprehensive agreement outlines the rights, obligations, and responsibilities of all parties in relation to the credit arrangement. Specifically, it details the financing arrangements, terms of borrowing, and the management of financial commitments, including provisions for scenarios involving Defaulting Lenders and the obligations of EEA Financial Institutions.

The Agreement serves as a critical document that governs the loan relationship, encompassing all conditions under which loans are provided and repaid. It is characterized by its adherence to the legal frameworks, such as the laws of the State of New York, under which it will be construed. Additionally, the Agreement is linked to other Loan Documents, which have been duly executed and delivered by the Borrower.

Overall, the term "AGREEMENT" encapsulates the formal legal framework that dictates how the involved parties interact, ensuring that their respective rights and obligations are clearly understood and enforceable.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-273fad25f21e3733d9bd3b4f4f05c87cc55bb9453212fdf3c7691185ee536587&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1a4b40fb4e1d23fccdbfe49f84af59e707d9fec7e183f7052d6148e7630846b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2951db15aa0742a2d43bdc126f93e2eba8a987444d5ce22c69f3f9840be94c51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6fecb6c14e74dc19c2d2c6c0027fa29dee78b526e13ea8a2ff95880d1d5fd24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a70fa6c5f50dc33cf7d4933da334c4321b8fa5279374e7f6cc64694458cdb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dab0531fa4fcf86f70f5a6e071aafc6b5ff5db2eaa35dfe862105382145767e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2bfe906a99dc77a8d4ae5a8cc5d7410e85fbdbb82f47beec1071bdf4298102&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf4652b795edde3461b7588a4ea05e72966da5628b2eeae43c81e9d27d9af992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-597b1ede56981d624f07ccc3f1c7ed2f4536e00810d740fb60781f9e5feb7ce8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c38a12ba82433270b2fc4359bfa48fd2baab5dad2c61ceb1e29ec15a6475843&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1be752fddafadca456c3e43e27d986816dd534c81a0fe1e60a9008d633a048d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1583e8d86bec46433cba76eeee6ae8e3d0cee281e57ae7251a6206ddbe83f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3fd5f2a6fbb9e2996bf6411ed3c5457faf2d2bd6c6bf8b0821ae37e4c465ac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c24e69b4e8b42b6f6b510e02c4bf724c6c72f9e44ce2093b3756bf1297429de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23bd31086495eab78486ce45d76c43d21a87e1a9c5113f67b406aa093affbd09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-245f24acd98603313a2446a8d5a32f7a192d4383d71b7f423ff6fdab962825e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78362831995eec40b3305bc8a7d598334904e9a3e5e4037fec3ad342ec088a9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14dc72f1acf50414a477c2db2c796ddbbd61a6a79ce8e689f589c7f4fe13c8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f940048c4d5b2bb225205fb7d95deb9809eacaf8b9d8f8727a53a822a960d8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75613d643837057320625a58ba941f8502befaca16be62f4c54375e5e369d410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5101875bbe6af73647ed36abe0f23011cd57aa7a0b2cfc76e2acb7141d4d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b51600eae536cd47259633337cdac9c729e6dcdfe218308793a634df08bf67a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d70cab643a5ecddd1b740e1e4acaa3c84ead62d9e90fb3c04b7381a845ad6613&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd2f3c18ca40f5744b1fae1009fdd54117d901009e82d32923eeabad1f6473ae</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EFFECTIVE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">The "Effective Date" refers to July 12, 2019, which signifies the formal commencement of contractual obligations as outlined in the credit agreement. This date marks the official point at which the agreement becomes active and binding for all parties involved, including the Borrower and Allergan. The Effective Date indicates when the Assignment and Assumption, along with various obligations, become enforceable. 

It is the date on which all parties have signed the agreement, ensuring that the contract is legally binding upon execution. This date is also relevant for changes and terms affecting the Borrower and its Subsidiaries as stated in the agreement. Specifically, it marks the commencement of obligations set forth in the credit agreement, certifying that no Default or Event of Default shall have occurred or would occur. 

Overall, the Effective Date is a crucial element of the agreement, denoting the time when obligations commence and all parties are bound by the terms specified in the document.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2a55c6b7f04b24ab285d974749d7dffb1b53e9f02ded348a822258c40bd47770&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a4b11d9d570dfb94869367bf658bbf44c8a288c83406b056f2db68067634598&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dece15a26450f3f3b7005a23a1a87b75619c152d1c0c3fb518d24ff11d52843a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58c9046d0a5484a6d24c79e57ff3a85f3a4fe99c02f6ce803165f080f36b286b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddc8ad50c1474639d452ac21cf074a091bed8d9d40db09df3a4b4bd23b32e37c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dab0531fa4fcf86f70f5a6e071aafc6b5ff5db2eaa35dfe862105382145767e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02df159aa8fd8baa02e06207b25febee2ff6252249087c7ca15d7ccbfb4802d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22981ba75cbdf796a13889f833879f18b5cb8cb79562d8354336d507ba15fd3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea2fcc7ba04310baa44bb49e42022c0e5cae9efe737efd7e3181f2be9502aaf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0ed6d0a7062e2fb3635c3defcdbad07963741b071cdc36d7c4b34749a2e718a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f1c734d846f35a655ca01c490cae44d5b50d73762de164b96169839717dc150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28b00f9050b45438aaf9a96762d4e5d77883ad3c6c6c0357a69caf07f0abf4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-515a1f26d42a2ffc1dced7e36195ac619bbb7de89e946f61c0ea6dedc03cb138&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0b256098128c95020c20f34577c7172b60522b7f1b6d5f27dde05471ddb586b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9596d6913071768b731e90c3fce70fd8e8b7dce447b1bd785f16af66c5018e80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2277d9071e073b486c921e5a5a70aadfb55298cb8f05fd2067d7a9260f30eded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f017c94dcbd47e1b84a1e23aa6ce599d075b32b712dd01a176cb8ce4431a2a80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c587e6b1345a423983f8f8f9bdc79596cc74be7c5d91c1332688e48263c116a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75613d643837057320625a58ba941f8502befaca16be62f4c54375e5e369d410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4c21c119b42c3a7bffab2cce7ed7a8ff74cb8c062ed13e11143a7d8e2d6a179&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02cd2de7855a70053b6f42c94faa792dc8fbc29bf53fd9cac8a0dca0ec0751b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0104bff9eb7c543e1a1b6a2643895187b79bfbd66162e3c78746048f7cd71d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fc31ef983e1fb2ce3b22784dd6f7b34a4f434eb6a46077483cb44955bbb2668</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSOLIDATED GROUP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">The "CONSOLIDATED GROUP" refers to a collective of entities associated with the Borrower, including the Borrower itself and its Subsidiaries. This group is considered together for the purposes of the credit agreement and is relevant to various duties of the Administrative Agent. The financial positions of these entities are consolidated for reporting and compliance with financial accounting standards. 

The Consolidated Group encompasses entities that operate together under common control or ownership, and it plays a crucial role in ensuring adherence to obligations specified in the credit agreement. This group is responsible for various business operations, regulatory compliance, and the management of guarantees related to financing obligations. 

Furthermore, the financial performance and the reporting of these entities are detailed throughout the credit agreement, making them significant for discussions regarding liabilities and obligations. The Consolidated Group is also characterized as a collective that may be referenced in fundraising or debt discussions, and it includes all entities whose financial results are consolidated for the purposes of reporting and legal obligations. Thus, the Consolidated Group represents a vital structure in the Borrower’s operations and compliance framework within the context of their financial agreements.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dece15a26450f3f3b7005a23a1a87b75619c152d1c0c3fb518d24ff11d52843a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c9bd21b64b200eb5b45b32553c4dacfef2d7eae4b803edeb5ad9b275a0824cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1a4b40fb4e1d23fccdbfe49f84af59e707d9fec7e183f7052d6148e7630846b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08604dcb4f12561e44bd132e16cc1c7302c5e67025a911d9017ef0fe05c72ff4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8f799d61b01f18934ea147ca074e5f3a01f511964c2cab511d835f90610d21b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7493bb66f0421335c6ef87034d49cf6bf9d3d02f08284e06abb442b159d239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58c9046d0a5484a6d24c79e57ff3a85f3a4fe99c02f6ce803165f080f36b286b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be2493d0103919c27e88c4d44795e6271de20e61d113f608a0e09b6a8035e77e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6fecb6c14e74dc19c2d2c6c0027fa29dee78b526e13ea8a2ff95880d1d5fd24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dab0531fa4fcf86f70f5a6e071aafc6b5ff5db2eaa35dfe862105382145767e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8728e39e0e185ee39416c3955fb41ec94d2eef3c5f813cb8b6099f868cf5e02a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f8d5bdd05b7cd0d1c2d946f291696266d96f16ce4e2c34eb03dcb8cc207d234&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0ed6d0a7062e2fb3635c3defcdbad07963741b071cdc36d7c4b34749a2e718a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdfa67546811206c5bc91d4f4c01b35c55878522beb7caefd3c918cc7bb0e4b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-644f37b010df65db1ef78b4233dc4b1dda2518dde20d55002acab8c9c4b9dada&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9596d6913071768b731e90c3fce70fd8e8b7dce447b1bd785f16af66c5018e80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1583e8d86bec46433cba76eeee6ae8e3d0cee281e57ae7251a6206ddbe83f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1be752fddafadca456c3e43e27d986816dd534c81a0fe1e60a9008d633a048d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2277d9071e073b486c921e5a5a70aadfb55298cb8f05fd2067d7a9260f30eded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-218e43d49365393bf48168169286d22a5df7ee1b88b398c5561de8f95be5878f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eddc25353ee9ca05b2f15a8a75b64381aa496d6afbc99dd68ffaa3c9aedb55d5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">The "Borrower" is a defined entity under the credit agreement, encompassing any individual, company, or legal entity that receives funds from lenders. The Borrower is primarily responsible for adhering to the terms stipulated in the agreement, which includes the obligation to repay the loan along with any accumulated interest and fees. This entity acknowledges and agrees to the terms of the credit agreement, thereby assuming a critical role in the compliance-related actions associated with the loan.

As part of its responsibilities, the Borrower commits to dispatching necessary documentation, such as the Takeover Offer Document, and maintaining communication with the Administrative Agent regarding the progress of such offerings. The Borrower is also responsible for providing information reasonably requested by the Administrative Agent or any Lenders, thus ensuring compliance with reporting requirements and financial covenants.

Throughout the text of the agreement, the Borrower is referenced multiple times in relation to its obligations, including the payment of principal, interest, and applicable fees. The Borrower must also ensure confidentiality and adhere to any representations and warranties outlined in the agreement's effective date. Furthermore, the Borrower retains rights concerning any participation sold by Lenders, exercising such rights as if the originating Lender were their direct creditor.

In summary, the Borrower is the entity engaged in the credit agreement, responsible for receiving the funds and fulfilling all obligations related to loan repayment, including compliance with various legal, financial, and contractual requirements.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d7e324da9ca1b1564ebc9a89d11b7e3f3471a27e48cdcb34c0c7216ce61d335f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c304cf98860a9b7cd463eae177e2e2d7d98281b29032cd76ecb286c9b22dcdde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-557ca50e2e7ed07027fe1bc3a3d46b4aca0b92a15a8793019d9d077f72596b84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2532dceb11310f90fe874dcb7a03665b47bca038a4f5360f466bf9fb8d95bca4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a4b11d9d570dfb94869367bf658bbf44c8a288c83406b056f2db68067634598&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dece15a26450f3f3b7005a23a1a87b75619c152d1c0c3fb518d24ff11d52843a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78950c530681eb30ebd5dd748958c0ddb8dd93b84a33af76f5beae6548792ae1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-273fad25f21e3733d9bd3b4f4f05c87cc55bb9453212fdf3c7691185ee536587&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c9bd21b64b200eb5b45b32553c4dacfef2d7eae4b803edeb5ad9b275a0824cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-750ac8915cdc1e091b22651f034329ee2d71a189874655a3a3f1357281f1f818&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1a4b40fb4e1d23fccdbfe49f84af59e707d9fec7e183f7052d6148e7630846b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59856153649b40596d478b3e3da65ad43c5f06c034b24225cd62242ce120ef82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08604dcb4f12561e44bd132e16cc1c7302c5e67025a911d9017ef0fe05c72ff4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-142c397a832b42dbdc53d33c57b5fc3071b7dd392bb60fa3e16f40ae3c2de06f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8f799d61b01f18934ea147ca074e5f3a01f511964c2cab511d835f90610d21b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73be087e93080f9e436892b7d182df66394bc79dbf5df119d9357df61b1ebbfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd234d70236eeaae31d80abc0de9ddf5a611a9d89e71a5bad6c336d9c7d4c8c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c5be4b86bb874c0ebcd5df3142d803b7aef8e7c1c715535d330936fe5a0dce9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2951db15aa0742a2d43bdc126f93e2eba8a987444d5ce22c69f3f9840be94c51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45657cee66f5d4dc6f4a2c3782e7a948a999592063dc6b41616722284ea13e80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d736172953986f05ce85f8300a40bec7b10118ae499cda09fcb21daf31749287&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58c9046d0a5484a6d24c79e57ff3a85f3a4fe99c02f6ce803165f080f36b286b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be2493d0103919c27e88c4d44795e6271de20e61d113f608a0e09b6a8035e77e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af58029e4df0f8a1b8f418a822a4bb9733084e07cb218e90801e810740e8705b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6fecb6c14e74dc19c2d2c6c0027fa29d