<node id="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">The term "Lender" refers to a financial institution or entity that provides loans to the Borrower, playing a critical role in the administration of the credit agreement. The Lender is responsible for disbursing funds, advancing money under the terms agreed upon, and monitoring compliance with all stipulations outlined in the credit agreement. This includes obligations related to confidentiality, security interests, and adherence to regulatory requirements. 

Each Lender has a duty to keep the Borrower and the Administrative Agent informed about the status of any forms or certifications that may expire or become inaccurate, ensuring timely updates are provided. Furthermore, Lenders must comply with the mandates of the Patriot Act, which requires them to obtain, verify, and keep records of identifying information regarding the Borrower and any Guarantors involved in the transaction.

On the Closing Date, the Lender is responsible for ensuring that the requisite portion of the funds, corresponding to its Applicable Lending Office, is available for the Borrower. This entity has rights concerning assignments and obligations under the agreement, engaging in the lending process as specified in documents such as the Administrative Questionnaire or the Assignment and Assumption document.

Overall, the Lender serves not only as the provider of funds for the Borrower but also as a crucial party in ensuring that all terms of the credit agreement are met and that any loan transactions, such as those associated with specific agreements like the Allergan Acquisition, are conducted smoothly and in compliance with all legal and regulatory frameworks.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-557ca50e2e7ed07027fe1bc3a3d46b4aca0b92a15a8793019d9d077f72596b84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c304cf98860a9b7cd463eae177e2e2d7d98281b29032cd76ecb286c9b22dcdde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a55c6b7f04b24ab285d974749d7dffb1b53e9f02ded348a822258c40bd47770&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2532dceb11310f90fe874dcb7a03665b47bca038a4f5360f466bf9fb8d95bca4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a4b11d9d570dfb94869367bf658bbf44c8a288c83406b056f2db68067634598&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-273fad25f21e3733d9bd3b4f4f05c87cc55bb9453212fdf3c7691185ee536587&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8ac583fbb163821277a58e5520f364c8b7ff6b8b1cac5c5f9ecaec9187807f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1a4b40fb4e1d23fccdbfe49f84af59e707d9fec7e183f7052d6148e7630846b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8f799d61b01f18934ea147ca074e5f3a01f511964c2cab511d835f90610d21b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73be087e93080f9e436892b7d182df66394bc79dbf5df119d9357df61b1ebbfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd234d70236eeaae31d80abc0de9ddf5a611a9d89e71a5bad6c336d9c7d4c8c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c5be4b86bb874c0ebcd5df3142d803b7aef8e7c1c715535d330936fe5a0dce9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2951db15aa0742a2d43bdc126f93e2eba8a987444d5ce22c69f3f9840be94c51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af58029e4df0f8a1b8f418a822a4bb9733084e07cb218e90801e810740e8705b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6fecb6c14e74dc19c2d2c6c0027fa29dee78b526e13ea8a2ff95880d1d5fd24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d26991303c01e9d7b44bf8a6408f5ea3b79465b3af06451be946611a033d74d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-866fe4ac1b993c84e8ec6b0b6c75c0299a953c019bffdef5132359bb147793f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fc4d08c3313588875690a6e3517754dd273e5008229a9650ffc8862e6d0c261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf4652b795edde3461b7588a4ea05e72966da5628b2eeae43c81e9d27d9af992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-597b1ede56981d624f07ccc3f1c7ed2f4536e00810d740fb60781f9e5feb7ce8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02df159aa8fd8baa02e06207b25febee2ff6252249087c7ca15d7ccbfb4802d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c38a12ba82433270b2fc4359bfa48fd2baab5dad2c61ceb1e29ec15a6475843&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09df4feeafeebaa1db1ae1c32b8120452e92a0f2f211ab28b71688732612bd4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f1c734d846f35a655ca01c490cae44d5b50d73762de164b96169839717dc150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdfa67546811206c5bc91d4f4c01b35c55878522beb7caefd3c918cc7bb0e4b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1be752fddafadca456c3e43e27d986816dd534c81a0fe1e60a9008d633a048d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1583e8d86bec46433cba76eeee6ae8e3d0cee281e57ae7251a6206ddbe83f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42655ae5c10ca5a5455649629ca19df62fdf6ee510c4c866b8072d6acd3b5aaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3fd5f2a6fbb9e2996bf6411ed3c5457faf2d2bd6c6bf8b0821ae37e4c465ac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23bd31086495eab78486ce45d76c43d21a87e1a9c5113f67b406aa093affbd09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c24e69b4e8b42b6f6b510e02c4bf724c6c72f9e44ce2093b3756bf1297429de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14dc72f1acf50414a477c2db2c796ddbbd61a6a79ce8e689f589c7f4fe13c8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f940048c4d5b2bb225205fb7d95deb9809eacaf8b9d8f8727a53a822a960d8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5101875bbe6af73647ed36abe0f23011cd57aa7a0b2cfc76e2acb7141d4d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be7bce265f7668641305b669fcfae3cec84ce21e98d4c457d96cadd73dddfbf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fc31ef983e1fb2ce3b22784dd6f7b34a4f434eb6a46077483cb44955bbb2668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78950c530681eb30ebd5dd748958c0ddb8dd93b84a33af76f5beae6548792ae1</data>
