<edge source="&quot;GUARANTOR&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">34.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Guarantors provide guarantees for the Borrower's obligations under the agreement to protect lenders against default."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower and Guarantor are connected through identification requirements set forth by Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower has a Guarantor that agrees to fulfill obligations if the Borrower defaults."|"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is responsible for ensuring that any required Guarantor executes and delivers a Guaranty to the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Guarantor provides assurance to the Lender by agreeing to repay the Borrower's loan if there is a default."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"Guarantee Requirements"&lt;SEP&gt;"Guarantee, Security"&lt;SEP&gt;"Guarantee, repayment"&lt;SEP&gt;"overlap"&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
