<edge source="&quot;ADVANCE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">37.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower has obligations related to the Advances, ensuring that any funds received must be repaid according to the credit agreement terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower receives Advances from the Lenders according to the commitments established in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower receives an Advance from the Lender, creating an obligation to repay the amount according to the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower receives the Advance from the Lender as part of the agreement, establishing the obligation to repay the borrowed amount."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower is required to repay the advance under the terms specified in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Funding"&lt;SEP&gt;"financial obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"financial transaction, obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"financing, borrowing"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-7af28d15bebf0aa3c3c5d3e5c5b05093f378e5f6d86107e87b93c7d9adb5bca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14dc72f1acf50414a477c2db2c796ddbbd61a6a79ce8e689f589c7f4fe13c8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8f799d61b01f18934ea147ca074e5f3a01f511964c2cab511d835f90610d21b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fc31ef983e1fb2ce3b22784dd6f7b34a4f434eb6a46077483cb44955bbb2668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c587e6b1345a423983f8f8f9bdc79596cc74be7c5d91c1332688e48263c116a</data>
