<edge source="&quot;CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ABBVIE INC.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ABBVIE INC. is a party to the Credit Agreement, which outlines its obligations and rights."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"AbbVie Inc. is the subject of obligations and rights outlined in the Credit Agreement, defining the terms of borrowing and repayment."</data>
