</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ASSIGNED INTEREST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The terms of the Assigned Interest are defined in relation to the rights outlined in the Credit Agreement and pertain to the obligations that pass from Assignor to Assignee."</data>
