<edge source="&quot;LENDERS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">69.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lenders provide loans to the Borrower, which must be repaid according to the terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower engages with the Lenders by receiving financing under the terms outlined in the Agreement."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower enters into a credit agreement with the Lenders, agreeing to repay funds provided under specific terms"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is contractually obligated to provide information and materials to the Lenders in accordance with the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is contractually obligated to repay the loan provided by the Lenders under the terms outlined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is obligated to fulfill terms set by the Lenders in the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is obligated to make payments to the Lenders according to the terms outlined in the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is obligated to repay the funds provided by the Lenders under the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must submit financial statements and other relevant reports to the Lenders as per the requirements set in the agreement."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower obtains a loan amount from the Lenders based on the agreed terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower receives funds from the lenders and is obligated to repay the loan under the terms specified in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Loan Agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"Repayment Obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"agreement, financing"&lt;SEP&gt;"contractual obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"financial transaction"&lt;SEP&gt;"loan provision"&lt;SEP&gt;"loan repayment"&lt;SEP&gt;"loan, obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"obligation, financial responsibility"&lt;SEP&gt;2)&lt;SEP&gt;submits reports</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-7af28d15bebf0aa3c3c5d3e5c5b05093f378e5f6d86107e87b93c7d9adb5bca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7e324da9ca1b1564ebc9a89d11b7e3f3471a27e48cdcb34c0c7216ce61d335f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58c9046d0a5484a6d24c79e57ff3a85f3a4fe99c02f6ce803165f080f36b286b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0b256098128c95020c20f34577c7172b60522b7f1b6d5f27dde05471ddb586b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-644f37b010df65db1ef78b4233dc4b1dda2518dde20d55002acab8c9c4b9dada&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f48aac073454f64321c0cdc25d2c032423f2d9bb3784ae8f741bfbe60eb624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8728e39e0e185ee39416c3955fb41ec94d2eef3c5f813cb8b6099f868cf5e02a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f67a33f5df6562c3788421c933dfc2f1287e8f4e4596bbd09e2b3a2f360ddf57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-245f24acd98603313a2446a8d5a32f7a192d4383d71b7f423ff6fdab962825e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-492bd425f44531b53e489ea3b2caba91dc56c30bd67efa35312d27305ba2b45f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd2f3c18ca40f5744b1fae1009fdd54117d901009e82d32923eeabad1f6473ae</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
