<edge source="&quot;LENDERS&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">66.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent acts as an intermediary, managing communications and distributing reports from the Borrower to the Lenders."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent acts on behalf of the Lenders to coordinate the advances and related obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent coordinates communication and notice delivery to the Lenders under the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent facilitates communication and operational management among the Lenders in relation to the Agreement."|&gt;"admin-agent-lender relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent facilitates communication between the Lenders and the Borrower about the Effective Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent facilitates the distribution of payments owed by the Borrower to the Lenders as per the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent manages the operational aspects, acting on behalf of the Lenders in relation to the credit agreement."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent manages the relationship and administrative operations on behalf of the Lenders in regard to the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent plays a crucial role in managing communications and actions between the Lenders and the Borrower in the context of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders rely on the Administrative Agent to determine and communicate applicable interest rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"The administrative agent oversees the execution and management of the lenders' obligations to the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Agent Facilitation"&lt;SEP&gt;"Coordination Role"&lt;SEP&gt;"coordination, communication"&lt;SEP&gt;"management role"&lt;SEP&gt;"management"&lt;SEP&gt;"management, coordination"&lt;SEP&gt;"payment distribution"&lt;SEP&gt;"reliance"&lt;SEP&gt;2)&lt;SEP&gt;8&lt;SEP&gt;manages communication</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-7af28d15bebf0aa3c3c5d3e5c5b05093f378e5f6d86107e87b93c7d9adb5bca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7e324da9ca1b1564ebc9a89d11b7e3f3471a27e48cdcb34c0c7216ce61d335f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0b256098128c95020c20f34577c7172b60522b7f1b6d5f27dde05471ddb586b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-644f37b010df65db1ef78b4233dc4b1dda2518dde20d55002acab8c9c4b9dada&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f48aac073454f64321c0cdc25d2c032423f2d9bb3784ae8f741bfbe60eb624&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8728e39e0e185ee39416c3955fb41ec94d2eef3c5f813cb8b6099f868cf5e02a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f67a33f5df6562c3788421c933dfc2f1287e8f4e4596bbd09e2b3a2f360ddf57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b51600eae536cd47259633337cdac9c729e6dcdfe218308793a634df08bf67a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3fd5f2a6fbb9e2996bf6411ed3c5457faf2d2bd6c6bf8b0821ae37e4c465ac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-492bd425f44531b53e489ea3b2caba91dc56c30bd67efa35312d27305ba2b45f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd2f3c18ca40f5744b1fae1009fdd54117d901009e82d32923eeabad1f6473ae</data>
