  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MATURITY DATE&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The lender defines the maturity date in the credit agreement, which indicates when the loan must be repaid."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Loan terms, repayment schedule"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-73be087e93080f9e436892b7d182df66394bc79dbf5df119d9357df61b1ebbfb</data>
