</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EUROCURRENCY RATE ADVANCE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower may revoke any request for a Eurocurrency Rate Advance during a Benchmark Unavailability Period."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower utilizes Eurocurrency Rate Advances under specific conditions set in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Loan Structure"&lt;SEP&gt;"Request"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-f67a33f5df6562c3788421c933dfc2f1287e8f4e4596bbd09e2b3a2f360ddf57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02cd2de7855a70053b6f42c94faa792dc8fbc29bf53fd9cac8a0dca0ec0751b7</data>
