</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EUROCURRENCY RATE ADVANCE&quot;" target="&quot;LIBOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Eurocurrency Rate Advance utilizes LIBOR as the base rate for determining the interest applicable for advances."</data>
  <data key="d6">"interest rate determination"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-59856153649b40596d478b3e3da65ad43c5f06c034b24225cd62242ce120ef82</data>
