  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOCUMENTATION AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent coordinates with the Documentation Agent to ensure all necessary documents for the credit agreement are in place."</data>
  <data key="d6">"coordination, documentation"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-597b1ede56981d624f07ccc3f1c7ed2f4536e00810d740fb60781f9e5feb7ce8</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXCLUDED TAXES&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Lender is indemnified by the Borrower for any Excluded Taxes imposed in relation to the Loan Document."</data>
  <data key="d6">"indemnified for taxes"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-557ca50e2e7ed07027fe1bc3a3d46b4aca0b92a15a8793019d9d077f72596b84</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;IMPACTED INTEREST PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower’s obligations are influenced by the terms set forth in the Impacted Interest Period in relation to the loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Obligation Influence"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-f67a33f5df6562c3788421c933dfc2f1287e8f4e4596bbd09e2b3a2f360ddf57</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELATED PARTIES&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent's Related Parties benefit from the provisions of the agreement as if they were named entities, allowing them to assist in various roles."</data>
  <data key="d6">"benefits, assist"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-5c5be4b86bb874c0ebcd5df3142d803b7aef8e7c1c715535d330936fe5a0dce9</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INDEMNIFICATION OBLIGATION&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is obligated to indemnify for taxes imposed under the Loan Document."</data>
  <data key="d6">"obligated to indemnify"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-557ca50e2e7ed07027fe1bc3a3d46b4aca0b92a15a8793019d9d077f72596b84</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CREDIT SUISSE AG, CAYMAN ISLANDS BRANCH&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Credit Suisse AG, Cayman Islands Branch participates in the loan agreement as a financial provider, offering significant loan commitments."</data>
  <data key="d6">"lender-participation, loan-agreement"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-0acc60f8a909dc9fb1cf54a1cf46218765eaf98dfc26d26b6f7432172f07047a</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGENT PARTIES&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent acts on behalf of the Agent Parties to manage the agreements and relationship with the Borrower and Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d6">administrative role</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-bf4652b795edde3461b7588a4ea05e72966da5628b2eeae43c81e9d27d9af992</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGENT PARTIES&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Related Parties to the Administrative Agent have specific liabilities and roles concerning the Borrower within the framework of the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">liability relationship</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-bf4652b795edde3461b7588a4ea05e72966da5628b2eeae43c81e9d27d9af992</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXISTING PUBLIC NOTES&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is obligated to service the Existing Public Notes as per the agreements made in the credit documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is responsible for honoring the debts associated with the Existing Public Notes as part of its financial obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Debt Management, Obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"debt obligation"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-59856153649b40596d478b3e3da65ad43c5f06c034b24225cd62242ce120ef82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eddc25353ee9ca05b2f15a8a75b64381aa496d6afbc99dd68ffaa3c9aedb55d5</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RESPONSIBLE OFFICER&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Responsible Officer is tasked with certifying in writing any changes related to the Guarantee Requirements that affect the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Responsible Officer is tasked with reporting any Defaults to the Administrative Agent, ensuring timely communication of fiscal issues."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Responsible Officer of the Borrower certifies information and documents required in the transaction process."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Certification Role"&lt;SEP&gt;reports</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-644f37b010df65db1ef78b4233dc4b1dda2518dde20d55002acab8c9c4b9dada&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0b256098128c95020c20f34577c7172b60522b7f1b6d5f27dde05471ddb586b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f1c734d846f35a655ca01c490cae44d5b50d73762de164b96169839717dc150</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NON-U.S. LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Non-U.S. Lender must deliver tax documentation to the Borrower to establish its exemption from U.S. withholding tax."&lt;SEP&gt;"The non-U.S. lender may request documentation from the borrower in relation to tax treaties benefiting interest rates."</data>
  <data key="d6">"documentation provision"&lt;SEP&gt;"requests documentation"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-750ac8915cdc1e091b22651f034329ee2d71a189874655a3a3f1357281f1f818&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be7bce265f7668641305b669fcfae3cec84ce21e98d4c457d96cadd73dddfbf0</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NON-U.S. LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;SECTION 881(C)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Non-U.S. lenders are subject to the regulations specified in Section 881(c) regarding portfolio interest."</data>
  <data key="d6">"subject to"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-be7bce265f7668641305b669fcfae3cec84ce21e98d4c457d96cadd73dddfbf0</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NON-U.S. LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Non-U.S. lenders must provide a certificate to the borrower claiming eligibility for tax exemptions."</data>
