  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WITHHOLDING TAX&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The lender may require documentation to exempt certain payments from withholding tax as per the loan agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"requires documentation"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-be7bce265f7668641305b669fcfae3cec84ce21e98d4c457d96cadd73dddfbf0</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LLOYDS BANK CORPORATE MARKETS PLC&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lloyds Bank Corporate Markets PLC is included as a lender in the credit agreement, contributing specified loan amounts."</data>
  <data key="d6">"lender-participation, loan-agreement"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-0acc60f8a909dc9fb1cf54a1cf46218765eaf98dfc26d26b6f7432172f07047a</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LONG STOP DATE&quot;" target="&quot;MANDATORY CANCELLATION EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Long Stop Date establishes a timeline for actions that may trigger a mandatory cancellation event."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Timeline, Obligation"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-40d0120536be1b8e96b2f903daf9881c37b0db7176468dc8bbbf490240624e03</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LONG STOP DATE&quot;" target="&quot;JUDGMENT CURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Judgment Currency defines the terms under which obligations must be settled by the Long Stop Date."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Settlement, Currency"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-40d0120536be1b8e96b2f903daf9881c37b0db7176468dc8bbbf490240624e03</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LONG STOP DATE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower must adhere to the Long Stop Date, which signifies critical deadlines within the context of the credit agreement."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">2)</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-bd2f3c18ca40f5744b1fae1009fdd54117d901009e82d32923eeabad1f6473ae</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BACKUP WITHHOLDING&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower must comply with tax withholding regulations, including backup withholding obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">"comply with"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-be7bce265f7668641305b669fcfae3cec84ce21e98d4c457d96cadd73dddfbf0</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARGIN STOCK&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower can use Margin Stock as collateral in securing their borrowed debts under the conditions of the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"collateral, security"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-9596d6913071768b731e90c3fce70fd8e8b7dce447b1bd785f16af66c5018e80</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE NORTHERN TRUST COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Northern Trust Company participates in the credit agreement as a lender, contributing to the total term loan commitments."</data>
  <data key="d6">"lender-participation, loan-agreement"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-0acc60f8a909dc9fb1cf54a1cf46218765eaf98dfc26d26b6f7432172f07047a</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ALLERGAN SHARES&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower's efforts to acquire Allergan Shares are central to the Takeover Offer process.")</data>
  <data key="d6">"acquisition target"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-23951530ecee6e7c315772c7d629c8dc076e9c6f9229da70b852f02977d99d02</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRINCIPAL&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is obligated to repay the Principal amount borrowed in accordance with the terms of the loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">"repayment"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-7e5101875bbe6af73647ed36abe0f23011cd57aa7a0b2cfc76e2acb7141d4d3d</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 2.14&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 2.14 obligates the Borrower to react to certain conditions that may arise regarding payments owed to the lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower's responsibilities as outlined in Section 2.14 include tax documentation and payment requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">"outlined in"&lt;SEP&gt;7</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-866fe4ac1b993c84e8ec6b0b6c75c0299a953c019bffdef5132359bb147793f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be7bce265f7668641305b669fcfae3cec84ce21e98d4c457d96cadd73dddfbf0</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GUARANTY&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower must ensure that the Guaranty is delivered to the Administrative Agent to maintain compliance with the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Compliance Requirement"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-6f1c734d846f35a655ca01c490cae44d5b50d73762de164b96169839717dc150</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GUARANTY&quot;" target="&quot;TRANCHE LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Guaranty provides assurance to the Tranche Lenders that obligations will be met by the Borrower, mitigating risk."</data>
  <data key="d6">"assurance, risk mitigation"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-b51600eae536cd47259633337cdac9c729e6dcdfe218308793a634df08bf67a7</data>
