  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORGAN STANLEY BANK, N.A.&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Morgan Stanley Bank, N.A. participates in the credit agreement as a lender, contributing specific loan amounts."</data>
  <data key="d6">"lender-participation, loan-agreement"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-0acc60f8a909dc9fb1cf54a1cf46218765eaf98dfc26d26b6f7432172f07047a</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EGM&quot;" target="&quot;REQUIRED EGM RESOLUTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The EGM is held to approve Required EGM Resolutions concerning the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Approval, Decision-making"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-40d0120536be1b8e96b2f903daf9881c37b0db7176468dc8bbbf490240624e03</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICABLE LENDING OFFICE&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Applicable Lending Office specifies the location and office of the Lender as defined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The lender's operations are closely associated with its Applicable Lending Office, which manages the specific loan commitments for borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d6">"operational management"&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-9d26991303c01e9d7b44bf8a6408f5ea3b79465b3af06451be946611a033d74d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8ac583fbb163821277a58e5520f364c8b7ff6b8b1cac5c5f9ecaec9187807f6</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICABLE LENDING OFFICE&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower interacts with the Lender's Applicable Lending Office for the administration of the loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">"interacts with, administration"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-557ca50e2e7ed07027fe1bc3a3d46b4aca0b92a15a8793019d9d077f72596b84</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 5.02&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is required to adhere to the stipulations outlined in Section 5.02 concerning negative covenants."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Covenant Commitment"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-6f1c734d846f35a655ca01c490cae44d5b50d73762de164b96169839717dc150</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;THE BANK OF NOVA SCOTIA&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Bank of Nova Scotia participates as a lender in the credit agreement, providing specified amounts of financing."</data>
  <data key="d6">"lender-participation, loan-agreement"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-0acc60f8a909dc9fb1cf54a1cf46218765eaf98dfc26d26b6f7432172f07047a</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICABLE MARGIN&quot;" target="&quot;BASE RATE ADVANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The applicable margin is added to the base rate to determine the interest on the base rate advances."</data>
  <data key="d6">"interest calculation"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-7af28d15bebf0aa3c3c5d3e5c5b05093f378e5f6d86107e87b93c7d9adb5bca5</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICABLE MARGIN&quot;" target="&quot;364-DAY TRANCHE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Applicable Margin is determined by reference to the Public Debt Rating associated with the 364-Day Tranche."</data>
  <data key="d6">9</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-f8ac583fbb163821277a58e5520f364c8b7ff6b8b1cac5c5f9ecaec9187807f6</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICABLE MARGIN&quot;" target="&quot;PUBLIC DEBT RATING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public Debt Ratings influence the determination of the Applicable Margin which varies according to the credit rating level."</data>
  <data key="d6">9</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-f8ac583fbb163821277a58e5520f364c8b7ff6b8b1cac5c5f9ecaec9187807f6</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REQUIRED EGM RESOLUTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;SCHEME DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Required EGM Resolutions are associated with the Scheme Documents to ensure proper execution of the acquisition as per legal requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">"association, legal compliance"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-bd234d70236eeaae31d80abc0de9ddf5a611a9d89e71a5bad6c336d9c7d4c8c6</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CERTIFICATION&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The lender must hold relevant certifications from the borrower regarding tax status for compliance."</data>
  <data key="d6">"requires certification"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-be7bce265f7668641305b669fcfae3cec84ce21e98d4c457d96cadd73dddfbf0</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRANSACTION&quot;" target="&quot;REQUIRED LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Certain Transactions undertaken by the Borrower require the approval of the Required Lenders as outlined in the Loan Documents."</data>
  <data key="d6">"approval, transaction"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-9596d6913071768b731e90c3fce70fd8e8b7dce447b1bd785f16af66c5018e80</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SOCIÉTÉ GÉNÉRALE&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Société Générale is part of the lending group in the credit agreement, providing crucial loan amounts."</data>
  <data key="d6">"lender-participation, loan-agreement"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-0acc60f8a909dc9fb1cf54a1cf46218765eaf98dfc26d26b6f7432172f07047a</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MOODY’S&quot;" target="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Moody’s provides credit ratings which can influence the Agreement's terms and the Borrower’s financial assessment."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">2)</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-bd2f3c18ca40f5744b1fae1009fdd54117d901009e82d32923eeabad1f6473ae</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC DEBT RATING&quot;" target="&quot;5-YEAR TRANCHE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The margins applicable to the 5-Year Tranche are set based on the corresponding Public Debt Rating."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Influence, Application"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-c01f63bff235f0de4fd04cc572f42b5048f051f30e90ff46450fed63088a2d1e</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC DEBT RATING&quot;" target="&quot;LEVEL 1: A+/A1 OR ABOVE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Public Debt Ratings categorize borrowers into levels, with Level 1 representing the lowest risk profile associated with the best applicable margins."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Categorization, Risk Profile"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-c01f63bff235f0de4fd04cc572f42b5048f051f30e90ff46450fed63088a2d1e</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC DEBT RATING&quot;" target="&quot;LEVEL 2: LESS THAN LEVEL 1 BUT AT LEAST A/A2&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Level 2 rating system reflects a moderate risk profile, impacting the margins applicable within the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Categorization, Risk Profile"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-c01f63bff235f0de4fd04cc572f42b5048f051f30e90ff46450fed63088a2d1e</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC DEBT RATING&quot;" target="&quot;LEVEL 3: LESS THAN LEVEL 2 BUT AT LEAST A-/A3&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This rating signifies a more significant risk compared to Level 1 and Level 2, affecting applicable fee margins in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Categorization, Risk Profile"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-c01f63bff235f0de4fd04cc572f42b5048f051f30e90ff46450fed63088a2d1e</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC DEBT RATING&quot;" target="&quot;LEVEL 4: LESS THAN LEVEL 3 BUT AT LEAST BBB+/BAA1&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Reflects a higher risk level, which directly influences the margins associated with commitment fees in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Categorization, Risk Profile"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-c01f63bff235f0de4fd04cc572f42b5048f051f30e90ff46450fed63088a2d1e</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC DEBT RATING&quot;" target="&quot;LEVEL 5: LESS THAN LEVEL 4 BUT AT LEAST BBB/BAA2&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This rating indicates increased risk, leading to higher margins for fees linked to the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Categorization, Risk Profile"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-c01f63bff235f0de4fd04cc572f42b5048f051f30e90ff46450fed63088a2d1e</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PUBLIC DEBT RATING&quot;" target="&quot;LEVEL 6: LESS THAN LEVEL 5&quot;">
