<edge source="&quot;ADVANCES&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">39.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower has obligations regarding the usage of Advances, specifically ensuring compliance with legal requirements and proper allocation of funds."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower has the right to draw Advances as per the terms stated in the credit agreement, which obligates them to repay these amounts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is entitled to receive Advances from Lenders, and these obligations can be terminated upon certain events."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is entitled to receive Advances from the lender(s) as part of the financing arrangement established in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower receives Advances, which represent the loan amount available under the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Financing, obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;"Use of Funds, Obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"financing, responsibilities"&lt;SEP&gt;"funding relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"receives; linked to"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-dece15a26450f3f3b7005a23a1a87b75619c152d1c0c3fb518d24ff11d52843a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eddc25353ee9ca05b2f15a8a75b64381aa496d6afbc99dd68ffaa3c9aedb55d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dab0531fa4fcf86f70f5a6e071aafc6b5ff5db2eaa35dfe862105382145767e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1583e8d86bec46433cba76eeee6ae8e3d0cee281e57ae7251a6206ddbe83f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75f1263fe25efcf5e1a778c55ad14ee6ff940f9a9148c8f1d0c8dff83e78bab7</data>
