<edge source="&quot;ASSIGNOR&quot;" target="&quot;ASSIGNEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">36.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ASSIGNEE agrees to assume the obligations previously held by the ASSIGNOR."&lt;SEP&gt;"The ASSIGNOR transfers its obligations to the ASSIGNEE in this Assignment and Assumption agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Assignor and Assignee agree to the terms of payment concerning amounts accrued before and after the Effective Date as stipulated in the Assignment and Assumption."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Assignor irrevocably sells and assigns its rights and obligations to the Assignee under the conditions stipulated in the Assignment and Assumption."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Assignment relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"assumption"&lt;SEP&gt;"binding, agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"transfer"</data>
