  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower’s interest payments are calculated based on the Base Rate, which determines the cost of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower is subject to the Base Rate defined in the Agreement, which influences overall borrowing costs."</data>
