</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TERM LOAN CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;PROJECT PICASSO&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Term Loan Credit Agreement is specifically associated with Project Picasso as the project for which the financing is structured."</data>
  <data key="d6">"is for"</data>
