</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXISTING CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is a party to the Existing Credit Agreement, responsible for adhering to its terms and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is subject to the terms of the Existing Credit Agreement, influencing new borrowings."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower's obligations include managing previous commitments established in the Existing Credit Agreement which may influence the current terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Financial History, Obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"Participatory role"&lt;SEP&gt;"reliance"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-218e43d49365393bf48168169286d22a5df7ee1b88b398c5561de8f95be5878f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eddc25353ee9ca05b2f15a8a75b64381aa496d6afbc99dd68ffaa3c9aedb55d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59856153649b40596d478b3e3da65ad43c5f06c034b24225cd62242ce120ef82</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRE-CLOSING FUNDED AMOUNT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower agrees that interest shall accrue on the Pre-Closing Funded Amount as if it had been advanced to the Borrower as an Advance."</data>
