<edge source="&quot;COMMITMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower relies on the Commitments made by lenders to secure financing as per the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitments represent the Borrower's obligation to comply with the financial terms set forth in the agreement."</data>
