</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMITMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">27.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Commitments represent the Lender's promise to make the Advances available to the Borrower under the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender agrees to fulfill the commitments made under the Agreement, providing a binding promise to extend credit as per the specified conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender's Commitments define their obligations to provide financing under specific conditions agreed upon in the Loan Documents."</data>
  <data key="d6">"financial obligation, agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"promises"&lt;SEP&gt;binding promise, financing</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-23bd31086495eab78486ce45d76c43d21a87e1a9c5113f67b406aa093affbd09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd234d70236eeaae31d80abc0de9ddf5a611a9d89e71a5bad6c336d9c7d4c8c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f940048c4d5b2bb225205fb7d95deb9809eacaf8b9d8f8727a53a822a960d8d</data>
