  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Allergan's significant Borrowed Debt obligations require guarantees that the Borrower must provide for compliance with the credit arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liens for property previously held by Allergan are associated with the Borrowed Debt, impacting collateral arrangements as outlined in the provisions."</data>
