</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ALLERGAN&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">32.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Allergan is recognized as the Borrower in the context of existing indebtedness on the Closing Date."|"&lt;SEP&gt;"Allergan's financial statements present the consolidated financial position of the Borrower, establishing a relationship based on financial accountability and scrutiny under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower intends to acquire shares from Allergan as outlined in the Takeover Offer Document and the Takeover Offer.")&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is in an agreement with Allergan, establishing mutual responsibilities and obligations in the credit arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is the main entity acquiring all shares of Allergan as part of the acquisition process under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower may engage in transactions involving Allergan as part of its operations as specified in the credit agreement."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"Acquisition, Main Entity"&lt;SEP&gt;"acquisition"&lt;SEP&gt;"financial relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"involves"&lt;SEP&gt;8&lt;SEP&gt;transaction&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-5282522a2e71f8e55b00655f1e0af06643a4a5cfaab99c8f9bd178c35e9ab337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3572813e4fb97fffeaa5cf8aa5591bc7eadcda80d2654bfbcfcc30832c77f0bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eddc25353ee9ca05b2f15a8a75b64381aa496d6afbc99dd68ffaa3c9aedb55d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dab0531fa4fcf86f70f5a6e071aafc6b5ff5db2eaa35dfe862105382145767e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23951530ecee6e7c315772c7d629c8dc076e9c6f9229da70b852f02977d99d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2277d9071e073b486c921e5a5a70aadfb55298cb8f05fd2067d7a9260f30eded</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
