</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EVENT OF DEFAULT&quot;" target="&quot;REQUIRED LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Required Lenders can act without the consent of the Borrower when an Event of Default occurs, allowing them to make crucial decisions regarding the loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">"acts, decisions"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-5c5be4b86bb874c0ebcd5df3142d803b7aef8e7c1c715535d330936fe5a0dce9</data>
