  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EVENT OF DEFAULT&quot;" target="&quot;EFFECTIVE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The certification of no Event of Default is necessary to affirm that all conditions are met on the Effective Date."</data>
  <data key="d6">"compliance certification"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-c28b00f9050b45438aaf9a96762d4e5d77883ad3c6c6c0357a69caf07f0abf4e</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EVENT OF DEFAULT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">26.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"In the case of an Event of Default, the Borrower may face consequences as stipulated in the Agreement, including immediate repayment."|&gt;"borrower-default relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"The occurrence of an Event of Default by the Borrower may trigger the appointment of a new Administrative Agent and affect the overall loan terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The occurrence of an Event of Default can trigger actions by Lenders, including the demand for repayment of Advances."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The occurrence of an Event of Default places an obligation on the Borrower to pay Default Interest."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Default, repayment"&lt;SEP&gt;"payment trigger"&lt;SEP&gt;"triggers, affects"&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-d7e324da9ca1b1564ebc9a89d11b7e3f3471a27e48cdcb34c0c7216ce61d335f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c5be4b86bb874c0ebcd5df3142d803b7aef8e7c1c715535d330936fe5a0dce9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1583e8d86bec46433cba76eeee6ae8e3d0cee281e57ae7251a6206ddbe83f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3fd5f2a6fbb9e2996bf6411ed3c5457faf2d2bd6c6bf8b0821ae37e4c465ac6</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL LAWS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower must comply with Environmental Laws to avoid legal repercussions and ensure operational sustainability."</data>
  <data key="d6">"regulatory compliance"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-b8f799d61b01f18934ea147ca074e5f3a01f511964c2cab511d835f90610d21b</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL LAWS&quot;" target="&quot;CONSOLIDATED GROUP&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Consolidated Group must comply with Environmental Laws which directly influences its operations and financial liabilities."</data>
  <data key="d6">"regulatory compliance"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-f0ed6d0a7062e2fb3635c3defcdbad07963741b071cdc36d7c4b34749a2e718a</data>
