  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COVENANTS&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The lender establishes covenants in the credit agreement to ensure the borrower adheres to agreed operational and financial standards."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Contractual obligations, operational standards"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-73be087e93080f9e436892b7d182df66394bc79dbf5df119d9357df61b1ebbfb</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COVENANTS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower agrees to follow the terms stipulated in the Covenants to maintain compliance with the loan agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"compliance"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-b8f799d61b01f18934ea147ca074e5f3a01f511964c2cab511d835f90610d21b</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REQUIRED LENDERS&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Certain actions under the Agreement require the consent of the Required Lenders, reinforcing their critical role in decision-making."|&gt;"lender-required relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender must comply with decisions made by the Required Lenders concerning any amendments or waivers under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"consent"&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-f3fd5f2a6fbb9e2996bf6411ed3c5457faf2d2bd6c6bf8b0821ae37e4c465ac6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5101875bbe6af73647ed36abe0f23011cd57aa7a0b2cfc76e2acb7141d4d3d</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REQUIRED LENDERS&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">36.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Required Lenders can notify the Administrative Agent regarding concerns about the Eurocurrency Rate and its reflection of costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Required Lenders must communicate their acceptance or objections regarding amendments to the Administrative Agent, highlighting their role in the decision-making process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent acts upon the consent or request of the Required Lenders to carry out necessary actions under the credit agreement."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent coordinates and communicates the decisions of the Required Lenders regarding the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent will notify the Required Lenders of any occurrence of a Benchmark Transition Event."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Required Lenders have the authority to appoint a successor Administrative Agent when the current agent resigns or is removed, overseeing the transition of responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Required Lenders work through the Administrative Agent to consent to actions regarding the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Required Lenders work with the Administrative Agent on significant decisions such as the Early Opt-in Election."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"Consent"&lt;SEP&gt;"Notification"&lt;SEP&gt;"appoints, oversees"&lt;SEP&gt;"consents"&lt;SEP&gt;"decision-making coordination"&lt;SEP&gt;"notification"&lt;SEP&gt;6</data>
