<edge source="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">44.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Agreement governs the terms and obligations of the Borrower and Lenders in the context of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Agreement specifies the borrower's rights and obligations under the loan."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower agrees to the terms laid out in the Agreement, which define repayment responsibilities and other obligations associated with the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower has executed the Agreement, signifying a contractual relationship with binding obligations and responsibilities as detailed in the terms."&lt;&lt;"contractual relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower has rights related to the assignment of the Lender's commitments under this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is a key party bound by the terms and conditions outlined in the Agreement for receiving financing."</data>
