<edge source="&quot;CONSOLIDATED GROUP&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">103.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Judgments or orders against the Consolidated Group may affect the Borrower's obligations or financial stability."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is a member of the Consolidated Group and incurs Borrowed Debt."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is a member of the Consolidated Group, allowing it to engage in specific financial activities and obligations under the Credit Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is a member of the Consolidated Group, indicating its inclusion in the obligations and compliance matters discussed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is a member of the Consolidated Group, which collectively holds financial interests in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is financially accountable and operates under the obligations set forth for the Consolidated Group, impacting its creditworthiness."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is obligation-bound to the Consolidated Group, impacting financial accountability and debts under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is part of the Consolidated Group which manages and operates under shared agreements and obligations."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is part of the Consolidated Group, which includes both the Borrower and its Subsidiaries."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is responsible for ensuring compliance among the members of the Consolidated Group regarding the agreement's terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is responsible for maintaining the financial health and operational transparency of the Consolidated Group."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is responsible for providing information related to their business, as it may involve the Consolidated Group's interests and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is responsible for the actions of the Consolidated Group, ensuring that all members comply with the terms of the receivable agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must provide a consolidated balance sheet and financial statements that represent the financial status of the Consolidated Group."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower's obligations are assessed in the context of the financial condition and debts of the Consolidated Group, impacting repayment capacity."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Compliance, Management"&lt;SEP&gt;"Judgments, obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;"accountability relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"financial responsibility"&lt;SEP&gt;"information, obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"member of; linked to"&lt;SEP&gt;"membership"&lt;SEP&gt;"membership, consolidation"&lt;SEP&gt;"obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"obligation, assessment"&lt;SEP&gt;"responsibility, oversight"&lt;SEP&gt;6&lt;SEP&gt;collaboration&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;reports on</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-218e43d49365393bf48168169286d22a5df7ee1b88b398c5561de8f95be5878f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0ed6d0a7062e2fb3635c3defcdbad07963741b071cdc36d7c4b34749a2e718a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be2493d0103919c27e88c4d44795e6271de20e61d113f608a0e09b6a8035e77e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dece15a26450f3f3b7005a23a1a87b75619c152d1c0c3fb518d24ff11d52843a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c9bd21b64b200eb5b45b32553c4dacfef2d7eae4b803edeb5ad9b275a0824cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eddc25353ee9ca05b2f15a8a75b64381aa496d6afbc99dd68ffaa3c9aedb55d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dab0531fa4fcf86f70f5a6e071aafc6b5ff5db2eaa35dfe862105382145767e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1a4b40fb4e1d23fccdbfe49f84af59e707d9fec7e183f7052d6148e7630846b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-644f37b010df65db1ef78b4233dc4b1dda2518dde20d55002acab8c9c4b9dada&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9596d6913071768b731e90c3fce70fd8e8b7dce447b1bd785f16af66c5018e80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1583e8d86bec46433cba76eeee6ae8e3d0cee281e57ae7251a6206ddbe83f43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08604dcb4f12561e44bd132e16cc1c7302c5e67025a911d9017ef0fe05c72ff4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8728e39e0e185ee39416c3955fb41ec94d2eef3c5f813cb8b6099f868cf5e02a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2277d9071e073b486c921e5a5a70aadfb55298cb8f05fd2067d7a9260f30eded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8f799d61b01f18934ea147ca074e5f3a01f511964c2cab511d835f90610d21b</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-ef0ff6e2b1ed8219e449e705d6553eb1bc013ea0540e1dcb68482041f8487491</data>
